<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vhangeri Ridonyohwa naMateo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Vhangeri ridonyohwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">naMateo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Mateo ndimwe romabhuku manai yomuChibvumirano Itsva rinodonongodza upenyu hwaJesu Khirisitu. Rimwe norimwe romabhuku yakareya rinodaidziwa kuti “Vhangeri,” zvichireva kuti, “Nyaya Dzidonaka.” Nyaya Dzidonaka dzidonyorewa naMateo, Mariko, Ruka, naJohwani mumasure mokupfa kwaJesu. Nyanzvi dzokudzidza dzinozivaba gore chairo ridonyohwa Vhangeri raMateo, asi zvinogona kunge dzaiva nguwa dzokumakore makumi matanhatu Khirisitu wabva kuzvahwa. Pakare nzvimbo yaridonyorehwa inozikanaba, asi vazinji vanondofungidzira kuti ridonyorehwa kuParasitaini uye munogona kuva muguta rikuru roJerusarema.</para>
  <para style="ip">Munyori ndiMateo, wanga ari muteresi kare Jesu asinati wamudaidza kuti ave mudzidzi wache. Waizikanawo nozita rokuti Revhi. Mateo wanga ari umwe woNhumwa gumi nodziiri uye adonyorera vaJudha. Izvi zvinonatsa kuoneka nozvinyohwa zvaanotora muChibvumirano Chokare zvinodarika makumi matanhatu. Waida kunangidza kuti Jesu ndiye Mesiya, muponisi, musaruhwa waMwari, adoporofitiwa. Mateo adonyorawo chaizvo pamusoro poumambo hwaMwari. VaJudha vaitarisira kuti Mesiya waidzova mambo womatongehwo yonyika. Mateo adonatsa kuita hanya kupikisa kutenda kudodaro achitsanangura umambo hwaMwari kuti ngwomweya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vhangeri ridonyohwa naMateo ibhuku ridonaka kuthanga naro Chibvumirano Chitsva nondava yozvinyohwa zvarene zvese zvomuChibvumirano Chokare. Rinobatanidza zviBvumirano zviiri. Nyanzvi dzokudzidza dzinopawo pfungwa yokuti pamwe Mateo waiedza kuteedzera marongehwo yomabhuku yaMozisi, yanova ndiyo mabhuku mashano yokuthanga muChibvumirano Chokare. Mharidzo yaJesu pagomo (5-7) inogona kuenzanisiwa nokupasa murairo kwaMwari kuna Mozisi (Dhotoronomi 19:3—23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo:</para>
  <para style="io1">Mateo anothanga vhangeri nokutaura mazvarihwo yaJesu Khirisitu nomathangiro youshumiri hwache muzvitsauko Mateo 1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera nyhokuti Mateo anotsanangura ushumiri hwaJesu nodzidziso dzache dzizinji muzvitsauko Mateo 5-25</para>
  <para style="io1">Chikamu chokupedzisira chaMateo chiri pamusoro poushumiri hwopamusorosoro hwaJesu hwokupfa nokumuka kwache Mateo 26-28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Madziteteguru yaJesu Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Ruka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Bhuku romadziteteguru yaJesu Khirisitu, mwanakomana waDhavhiti, mwanakomana waAbhurahamu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abhurahamu waiva baba vaIsaki, Isaki waiva baba vaJakobho, Jakobho waiva baba vaJudha novakoma vache, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Judha waiva baba vaPerezi naZera vaadozvara naTamari, futi Perezi baba vaHezironi, Hezironi waiva baba vaRami, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Rami waiva baba vaAminadhabhi, Aminadhabhi waiva baba vaNashoni, Nashoni waiva baba vaSarimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Sarimoni waiva baba vaBhowazi waadozvara naRahabhi, Bhowazi waiva baba vaObhedhi waadozvara naRute, Obhedhi waiva baba vaJese,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Jese waiva baba vamambo Dhavhiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Dhavhiti waiva baba vaSoromoni waadozvara nomukadzi waUriya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Soromoni waiva baba vaRehobhoami, Rehobhoami waiva baba vaAbhija, Abhija waiva baba vaAsa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa waiva baba vaJehoshafati, Jehoshafati waiva baba vaJoramu, Joramu waiva baba vaUziya, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uziya waiva baba vaJotamu, Jotamu waiva baba vaAhazi, Ahazi waiva baba vaHezekiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya waiva baba vaManase, Manase waiva baba vaAmosi, Amosi waiva baba vaJosiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />futi Josiya waiva baba vaJekoniya novakoma vache, panguwa yokutapiwa kuenda kuBhabhironi.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Mumasure mokutapiwa kuenda kuBhabhironi, Jekoniya adova baba vaSharitieri, Sharitieri waiva baba vaZerubhabheri, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubhabheri waiva baba vaAbhiudhi, Abhiudhi waiva baba vaEriyakimu, Eriyakimu waiva baba vaAzori, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azori waiva baba vaZadhoki, Zadhoki waiva baba vaAkimu, Akimu waiva baba vaEriudhi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eriudhi waiva baba vaErieza, Erieza waiva baba vaMatani, Matani waiva baba vaJakobho, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Jakobho waiva baba vaJosefa murume waMariya adozvara Jesu anoitiwa Khirisitu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Saka kubva pana Abhurahamu kusvika pana mambo Dhavhiti pano mazera gumi nomanai, kubva pana mambo Dhavhiti kusvika pakutapiwa kuenda kuBhabhironi pano mazera gumi nomanai, kubva pakutapiwa kuenda kuBhabhironi kusvika pana Khirisitu pano mazera gumi nomanai.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzvahwa kwaJesu Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Ruka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Zvino kuzvahwa kwaJesu Khirisitu kudoitika nonzira idodai. Amai vache Mariya vanga vadobvunzihwa naJosefa, vasati vagara vese adooneka waanomimba yoMweya Mutsvene. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Manje murume wache Josefa, semunhu wanga adorurama haanai kuda kumunyadzisa, adofunga kumuramba kabisira. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Asi achiri kufunga zvakarezvo, ngirozi yaIshe idobva yazviratidza kwaari pakurota ichiti, “Josefa mwanakomana waDhavhiti, reka kucha kutora Mariya kuti ave mukadzi wako, ndava mimba yaanayo njoMweya Mutsvene. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Iye achapona mwana mukomana, wodzomutenza zita rokuti Jesu, ndava ndiye achaponesa vanhu vache kubva pazvitema zvavo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Zvakarezvi zvese zvidoitika kuzazisa zvidonyaihwa naIshe nomuromo womuporofiti: <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Nangarai, mhandara ichava nomimba yozvara mwanakomana, zita rache richaitiwa Manuwere” (zvinoreva kuti Mwari anesu).<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Josefa paadomuka pahope, adoita zvaadoudziwa nongirozi yaIshe, adomutora kuva mukadzi wache, <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />asi haanai kumuziva kusvikira wapona mwana womukomana, achibva wamutenza zita rache rokuti Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Varume Vaidzidza zvoNyenyedzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Zvino Jesu paadozvahwa muBheterehema roJudhiya mumazuva yamambo Herudhe, varume vaidzidza zvonyenyedzi vadosvika muJerusarema vachibva kumabvazuva. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Vadoti, “Ari poi uyo adozvahwa ari mambo wovaJudha? Ndava tidoona nyenyedzi yache kumabvazuva, tauya kudzomunamata.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Zvino mambo Herudhe paadonzva zvakarezvo, adonetseka pabodzi novese muJerusarema. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Adounganidza vaphirisita vakuru vese novadzidzisi vovanhu, achivabvunza kwaidzozvarihwa Khirisitu.<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Vadomunyepa kuti, “MuBheterehema roJudhiya. Ndava ndizvo zvidonyohwa nomuporofiti achiti,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Naiwepa Bheterehema munyika yaJudha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ndiweba mudikitsa pakati povatongi vovaJudha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Ndava mauri muchabva mutongi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">acharisa vanhu vangu vaIzirairi.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Pakarepo Herudhe adodaidza kabisira varume vaidzidza zvonyenyedzi kuti azive kubva kwavari nguwa idooneka nyenyedzi. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Adovatuma kuBheterehema achiti, “Endai kobvunzitsitsa zvomwana, kana mamuwana mundivikhire shoko, kuti nainipanowo ndiuye kudzomunamata.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Pavadonzva mambo vadopinda munzira yavo. Pakarepo vadobva vaona nyenyedzi yavanga vaona kumabvazuva yaakuvatungamira, kusvikira yamira pamusoro panzvimbo yanga ino mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Pavadoona nyenyedzi vadoingidzika kufara nomufaro mukuru. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Pavadopinda mumba vachiona mwana naMariya amai vache. Vadokotamira pasi vachimunamata. Ipopo vadovhura zvipo zvavo ndokumupasa, ndarama, zvinonushira nomura.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Kudzoti vachenjedzewa muchiroto, kuti vareke kudzokera kuna Herudhe, vadoenda kunyika yavo noimwe nzira.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutizira kuIjipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Vadzidzi vonyenyedzi pavadondobva, ngirozi yaIshe idozvinangidza kuna Josefa muchiroto ichiti, “Sumuka, utore mwana namai vache, utizire kuIjipiti. Ugare kwakareko kusvikira ndakunyepa, ndava Herudhe wava kutsvaga mwana kuti amupunze.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Ipopo Josefa adomuka usiku ndokutora mwana namai vache, ndokuenda kuIjipiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Vadogara kwakareko kusvikira pakupfa kwaHerudhe. Uku kwanga kuri kuzazisa zvidonyaihwa naIshe kuburikidza nomuporofiti achiti, “Kubva kuIjipiti ndidodaidza mwanakomana wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupunziwa Kwovakomana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Zvino Herudhe paadoona kuti wabatisiwa dombo novarume vaidzidza zvonyenyedzi, adopupuma noukari. Adobva waraira kuti vanakomana vese vanomakore mairi zvichidzika vapunziwe muBheterehema, nomudunhu rese. Zvichienderana nonguwa idotauhwa novarume vaidzidza zvonyenyedzi.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ipopo padozazisiwa zvidonyaihwa namuporofiti Joromiya achiti,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Izvi ridonzvika muRama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">maundu nomhere ikuru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rakeri achiririra vana vache,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">achiramba kunyaradziwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ndava havachisipo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudzoka kubva kuIjipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Kudzoti Herudhe wapfa, ngirozi yaIshe idozvinangidza kuna Josefa mukurota muIjipiti, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />ichiti, “Sumuka, utore mwana namai vache muende kunyika yaIzirairi, ndava vaye vaitsvaga upenyu hwomwana, vadopfa.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Adosumuka ndokutora mwana namai vache, vachidzokera kunyika yaIzirairi.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Asi paadonzva kuti Akerausi wava kutonga kuJudhiya pachinzvimbo chababa vache Herudhe, adocha kukuenda pakare. Nokuchenjedzewa muchiroto, adodzonanga kudunhu rikuru roGaririya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Adoenda kogara muguta rinoitiwa Nazareta, kuti zvidonyaihwa novaporofiti zvokuti, “Achatenzewa kuti muNazarini,” zvizazisiwe.<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuparidza kwaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Ruka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Johwani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mumazuva yakareyo Johwani Muombeki adouya achiparidza ari musango roJudhiya. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Adoti, “Pindukai, ndava umambo hwokudenga hwanyedza papfupi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Nokuti wakareyu ndiye adorehwa nomuporofiti Isaya paadoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Izvi roanokuwa musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘nhadzirai mugwagwa waIshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">yororai nzira dzache!’”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Zvino Johwani waisimira mbacha dzoukuse hwongamera, nobhande rochikumba muchiuno chache. Zvokuja zvache yanga yari mabombo nouchi hwomusango. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />VoJerusarema noJudhiya rese nodunhu rese ridopoteredza hwizi hwoJorodhani vadosvokonoka kuenda kwaari. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Vadoombekewa naye muhwizi roJorodhani, musure mokureurira zvitema zvavo.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Asi paadoona vazinji vovaFarisi novaSadhusi vachiuya kudzoombekewa naye, adoti kwavari, “Naimi vana vonyoka, mbani adokuchenjedzai kuti mutize ukari hunouya? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Itai ndipo zvibereko zvinoenderana nokupinduka kwacho. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Rekai kufunga muchizviti, ‘Tiri vana vaAbhurahamu.’ Ndava ndinokunyepai kuti, Mwari anogona kumutsira Abhurahamu vana kubva pamabhwe iyoya. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Kudaiku, sanho ratogwama mudzi womuti. Muti wese usingabereke muchero udonaka unogwatiwa uchikhandiwa mumoto.” <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />“Inipano ndinokuombekai nomvura nokuti mapinduka. Asi ari kuuya mumasure mangu, mukuru kwandiri, inini ndinokodzeraba kutakura shangu dzache, iyeyo ndiye achakuombekai noMweya Mutsvene nomoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Chisero chache chokuurutsisa anacho mujanja, achanatsa kuchenesa udzire hwache, gorosi achariunganidzira muchitura, asi hundi achaipisa nomoto usingadzimwe.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuombekewa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mariko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Ruka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Zvino Jesu adouya kuJorodhani achibva kuGaririya kudzoombekewa naJohwani. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Asi Johwani adoda kumurambidza, achiti, “Inipano ndini ndinoda kuombekewa naimipa, manje mouya kwandiri kamu?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Asi Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Iyezvino reka zviite daro, ndava zvidofanira kuti tizazise kururama kwese.” Ipopo Johwani adobva wabvuma.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Zvino Jesu paadoombekewa, adobirika mumvura kabodzi nokabodzi. Pakarepo matenga yadozururiwa futi adoona Mweya waMwari achiburuka adoita kunge njiva ndokuvhoda paari. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Zvino izvi ridobva kudenga richiti, “Wakareyu ndiye Mwanakomana wangu wandinoditsitsa, futi ndinofadziwa maninge naye.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuedzewa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mariko 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Ruka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Zvino Jesu adotungamihwa noMweya kusango, kuti aedzewe najabhurosi. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Adotsanya kwomazuva makumi manai nousiku makumi manai, mumasure mozvakarezvo adonzva nzara. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Muyedzi adouya ndokuti kwaari, “Kana uri Mwanakomana waMwari, raira mabhwe yakareya kuti yave mazingwa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Asi adomupindura achiti, “Kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Munhu anoraramaba nomazingwa chete, asi noshoko rese rinobirika mumuromo maMwari.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Zvino jabhurosi adomutora ndokumuendesa kuguta ritsvene, achibva wamuisa pakatorotoro poimba yaMwari. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Adoti kwaari, “Kana uri Mwanakomana waMwari, zvikhandire pasi, ndava kudonyohwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Acharaira ngirozi dzache pamusoro pako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">dzichakukacha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">kuti gumbo rako rireke kurovera padombo.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Kudonyohwa pakare kuti, ‘Damba kuedza Ishe Mwari wako.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Jabhurosi adomutora pakare ndokuenda naye kugomo rirefurefu ndokumunangidza umambo hwese hwopasi nombiri yahwene. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Adobva wamuti, “Ndichakupasa zvakarezvi zvese, kana ukandipfugamira nokundinamata.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Manje Jesu adoti kwaari, “Birikapa Sathani! Ndava kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Uchanamata Ishe Mwari wako basi, iye chete ndiye waunoshumira.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ipopo jabhurosi adomusiya, zvino ngirozi dzidouya ndokumushandira.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anothanga Basa Rache muGaririya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mariko 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Ruka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Zvino paadonzva kuti Johwani wasungiwa, adoenda kuGaririya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Paadobirika muNazareta, adoenda kogara kuKaperenaume, papfupi nogungwa, mudunhu roZebhuruni noNafutari. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Kuti zvidonyaihwa nomuporofiti Isaya zvizazisiwe zvokuti,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Nyika yoZebhuruni nonyika yoNafutari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">kunzira inonanga kugungwa, padonangarana noJorodhani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Gaririya rovasiri vaJudha,<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />vanhu vaigara murima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">vadoona chiedza chikuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">pana ivo vaigara munyika yomumvuri worufu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">chiedza chidovhenekera.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kubva panguwa yakareyo Jesu adothanga kuparidza achiti, “Pindukai, ndava umambo hwokudenga hwanyedza papfupi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodaidza Vabati Vohove Vanai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mariko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Ruka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Paanga achifamba panyasi pogungwa roGaririya, adoona vairi, mukoma nomunin'ina, Simoni anoitiwa Pita naAndireya, vachikhanda mambure yavo mugungwa, ndava vaiva vabati vohove. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Adoti kwavari, “Nditeverei, ndichakuitai varauri vovanhu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Kabodzi nokabodzi vadosiya mambure yavo vachibva vamutevera.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Achibirika kubva pakarepo adoona vamwe vairi mukoma nomunin'ina, Jakobho naJohwani, vanakomana vaZebhedhiya. Vanga vari mukamwadiya pabodzi nababa vavo Zebhedhiya, vachisonanidza mambure yavo. Jesu adobva wavadaidza, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />pakarepo vadosiya kamwadiya nababa vavo, ndokumutevera.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ushumiri hwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Ruka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Adotenderera muGaririya rese, achidzidzisa mumasinagoge yavo, achiparidza vhangeri roumambo, nokuporesa matenda yese nohodza dzese pakati povanhu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Zvino mukurumbira wache udosvika kunyika inoitiwa Siriya kwese, vadouya kwaari novahwere vese, vaishupika nomatenda nomahwadzo, novaiva nomashave, novaiva nopfavi, novanga vadotonhora nhengo. Adobva wavaporesa. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Gurusvusvu rikuru ridomutevera richibva muGaririya nomuDhikaporisi, nomuJerusarema, nomuJudhiya, nokumhiri kwaJorodhani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Mharidzo paGomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Paadoona magurusvusvu yovanhu, adokwira mugomo, ndokugarikika pasi. Vadzidzi vache vadouya kwaari. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Adothanga kuvadzidzisa ndokuti,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makomborero yoChokwadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Ruka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Vadokomborehwa varombo pamweya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">ndava umambo hwokudenga ngwavo.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Vadokomborehwa vanorira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">ndava vachanyaradziwa!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Vadokomborehwa vadopfava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">ndava vachagara nhaka yonyika.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Vadokomborehwa vanonzara nonyota yokururama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">ndava vachagutsiwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Vadokomborehwa vano tsitsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">ndava vachaitihwa tsitsi.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Vadokomborehwa vadochena pamwoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">ndava vachaona Mwari.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Vadokomborehwa vanoyananisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">ndava vachanzi vana vaMwari.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />“Vadokomborehwa vanotambudzihwa kururama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">ndava umambo hwokudenga ngwavo.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Mudokomborehwa vakaremi kana vanhu vachikutukanai vachikutambudzai vachinyaira zvidoipa zvese zvomabwodo pamusoro penyu nondava yangu. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Farai nokuita mufaro udonyanya, ndava mubairo wenyu udokuritsa kudenga. Matambudziro yavanoita vanhu vakareva ndomwenze yavadoita kuvaporofiti vadokuthangirai.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muri Mwinyu noChiedza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mariko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Ruka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Imipa muri mwinyu wonyika, asi kana mwinyu wataya kuvava kwawene kungadzotsehwe tini? Hauchinai kabonyo, saka unotayiwa wotsikiwa novanhu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Muri chiedza chonyika. Guta riri pagomo rinosvisvikaba. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Vanhu havabatidze mwenje vachiuisa pasi potsvanda, asi pachigadziko chomwenje kuti uvhenekere vese vari mumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Chiedza chenyu mbachivhenekere vanhu kuti vaone buya renyu, vakudze Baba venyu vari kudenga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poMutemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Rekai kufunga kuti ndidouya kudzopfudza mutemo nozvinyohwa zvovaporofiti. Ndidouyaba koipfudza asi kudzoizazisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Ndava pachokwadi ndinoti kwamuri kusvikira denga nonyika zvapfuruka, hapanai kachikamu kadikidiki kana kabhii kangabvisiwe pamutemo kusvikira zvese zvazazisiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Wese anochora umwe womitemo mudikidiki panoyakarei, achidzidzisa vanhu kuita zvakarezvo, achaitiwa mudikidiki muumambo hwokudenga. Asi anoiita achiidzidzisa, achaitiwa mukuru muumambo hwokudenga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ndava ndinokunyepai, kuti kana kururama kwenyu kukareka kukunda kwovanyori novaFarisi, munopindaba muumambo hwokudenga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poKureka kuita Ukari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mudonzva kuti zvidotauhwa kuvanhu vokare kuti, ‘Reka kubaya, wese anobaya achatongewa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Asi Inipano ndinoti kwamuri, wese anoitira ukari hama yache waparamura mhosva ichatongewa. Wese anotukana hama yache, wasora dare, nowese anoti, ‘Iwe dzemwa!’ achava nomhosva yogehena romoto. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Saka kana uchipereka chipo chako paatari, ukayeuka kuti hama yako ino chinhu chaidotsvatsvanira naiwewe, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />siya chipo chako paataripo, uende kothanga wayanana nohama yako, wodzouya wopereka chipo chako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Uchiri kuenda kudare nomunenedzeri wako, kurumidza kuwirirana naye, kuti munenedzeriyo areke kukupereka kumutongi, mutongi wodzokuisa kumupurisa uchibva wavharihwa mutorongo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, unomubirikaba kusvikira waripa kamari kokupedzisira”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poKureka kuita Upombwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mudonzva zvichinzi, ‘Reka kuita upombwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Asi Inipano ndinoti kwamuri, wese anonangara munhukadzi achibva wamuchiva watoita upombwe naye mumwoyo mache. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Kana ziso rako roruji richikukonzera kutadza, ritokonore uritaye! Hasa kutaikihwa nochidzu chibodzi panokuti muiri wako wese ukhandiwe mugehena. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Kana ruoko rako roruji richikukonzera kutadza, rigwate uritaye. Hasa kusaya chimwe chidzu panokuti muiri wako wese ukhandiwe mugehena.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poKureka Kurambana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mariko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Ruka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Zvidonzi pakare, ‘Wese anoramba mukadzi wache, mbaamupase gupuro.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Asi ndinoti kwamuri, wese anoramba mukadzi wache kunze kwokuti wahura, anomuitisa hure, nowese anoroora mukadzi adorambiwayo anoita upombwe.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso pamusoro poKurega kupika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Pakare mudonzva zvichinzi kuvanhu vokare, ‘Reka kupika zvomabwodo. Asi unofanira kuitira Ishe zvaudopikira.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Asi ndinoti kwamuri, ‘Rekeraifuti kupika, kana nodenga ndava nyhigaro chaMwari choushe. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Kana nonyika, ndava nyhitsiko chotsoka dzache, kana kuti noJerusarema, ndava iguta raMambo mukuru. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Futi rekai kupika nomusoro wenyu, ndava munokonaba kuita kuti bvudzi ribodzi rive richena kana rizvipa. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Kunyaira kwenyu mbakundova, ‘Inde’ kana ‘Neye’ chese chinopindiridza ipopa chinobva kuno adoipa.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poKurega kutsiidza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Ruka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mudonzva kuti zvidonzi, ‘Ziso rinotsiviwa noziso, zino nozino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Asi ndinoti kwamuri, ‘Rekai kurambidza adoipa. Asi kana umwe akakurova padama rokuruji, muperekere rimwe racho. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Futi kana pakaita anokusungisa kuti atore hembe yako, mureke atorewo nobhache rako kamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Kana munhu akakusukumidza kutekaira huri ibodzi, tekaira naye huri dziiri. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Pasa anokuruvira, futi reka kurambira anoda kukukwereta.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rudo kuVavengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Ruka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mudonzva kuti zvidonzi, ‘Unofanira kuda muvakhidzani wako, wozonda muvengi wako.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Asi ndinokunyepai kuti, idai vavengi venyu munamatire vanokutambudzai, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />kuti muve vanakomana vaBaba venyu vari kudenga. Ndava vanobuditsira zuva ravo kuno vadoipa novadonaka, nokunisira mvura vadorurama novasinai kururama. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ndava kana muchindoda vaye vanokudai, muno mubairo wei? Anga naivo vateresi vanoitaba zvibodzibodzizvo nai? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Futi kana muchimoresa hama dzenyu basi, chii chamuri kuita chinokunda vamwe? Ko vasiri vaJudha vanoitaba zvibodzibodzizvo? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Saka munofanira kuva vadokwana, saBaba venyu vokudenga vadokwana.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poRudo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Chenjerai kumboitira buya panovanhu kuti vakuonei, ndava munodzowanaba mubairo kubva kuna Baba venyu vari kudenga.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Saka kana muchipereka ruyamuro, rekai kuti zvizikane, fanike zvinoitiwa novanyengeri mumasinagoge nomumigwagwa, kuti varumbidziwe novanhu. Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, vatotambira mubairo wavo. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Asi kana muchipereka ruyamuro, rekai kuita kuti ruoko renyu romamose rizive zviri kuitiwa noruoko renyu roruji peno. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Kuitira kuti ruyamuro renyu rive romuchihwande. Ndava Baba venyu vanoona zvomuchihwande vachakupasai mubairo.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poMunamato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Ruka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Futi kana muchinamata, rekai kuita kunge vanyengeri, ndava vanofarira kunamata vadomira mumasinagoge nopamhararano dzonzira, kuti vaonewe novanhu. Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, vatotambira mubairo wavo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Asi kana maakunamata, pindai mumba menyu mukwedekere sasa, monamata kuna Baba venyu ari padohwanda. Ivo Baba vako vanoona padohwanda vachakupasa mubairo peno.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Pakare pakunamata rekai kumbondotutira mashoko kunge zvinoitiwa novasiri vaJudha, ndava vanofunga kuti vachanzviwa nokuda kwomashoko yavo mazinji. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Rekai kuita kunge vakarevo. Ndava Baba venyu vanoziva zvamunoda musinati mavakumbira. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Saka namatai muchidai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Baba vedu vari kudenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Zita renyu mbarikudziwe noutsvene,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />umambo hwenyu mbahuuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">kuda kwenyu mbakuitiwe panyika sezvazviri kudenga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Tipasei nasi kuja kwedu kwomazuva yese.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Mutiregerere kutadza kwedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">sekuregererawo kwatinoita vanotitadzira.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Rekai kutipinza pamuedzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Asi tihwirei kubva pano adoipa.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Ndava kana muchiregerera vanhu kutadza kwavo, Baba venyu vokudenga vachakuregereraiwo. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Asi kana musingaregerere vanhu kutadza kwavo, naBaba venyu havakuregerereiwo kutadza kwenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzidziso Pamusoro poKutsanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Pakare kana muchitsanya, rekai kuoneka kudodoma kaso, kunge vanyengeri. Ndava vanosina pazviso kuti kutsanya kwavo kuonewe novanhu. Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, vatotambira mubairo wavo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Asi kana uchitsanya, shamba chiso chako uzore mapfuta musoro wako, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />kuti kutsanya kwako kureke kuonewa novanhu asi naBaba vako vari padohwanda. Ivo Baba vako vanoona padohwanda vachakupasa mubairo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfuma yoKudenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Ruka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Rekai kuzvichengetera pfuma panyika, pano tukumo nongura zvinoiparadza nombavha dzinopasura dzichiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Asi, zvichengeterei pfuma kudenga, kusinai tukumo nongura zvinoiparadza, kusinai kamu mbavha dzinophasura dzichiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ndava pano pfuma yako nomwoyo wako uchavawo pakarepo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwenje woMuviri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Ruka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Ziso ndiro mwenje womuviri. Saka kana ziso rako ridonaka, muviri wako wese unenge udozara chiedza, <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />asi kana ziso rako ridonyangara, muviri wako wese unenge udozara rima. Manje kana chiedza chiri mauri chiri rima, rima rakarero ridokungudza peno!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwari noPfuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Ruka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Hapanai angashandire anatenzi vairi, ndava achavenga mubodzi achida umwe, kana kuti achatetekera mubodzi achinyozera umwe. Hamukwanise kushandira Mwari nomari.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Saka ndinokunyepai, kuti mureke kushushikana pamusoro poupenyu hwenyu chamuchaja kana chamuchamwa, kana pamusoro pomuiri wenyu chamuchasimira. Ko upenyu hunokundaba chokuja nai, nomuviri unokundaba chokusimira nai? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Nangarai tushiri tomudenga, hatujari kana kukohwa kana kuunganidzira muzvitura, asi zvidodaipo Baba venyu vokudenga vanotuposha! Ko imipa mudokoshaba kutukunda? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Anga mbani wenyu angaingidzire kurepha kwoupenyu hwache nokushushikana?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Manje munonetsekerei pamusoro pozvokusimira? Cherechedzai maruva yomusango kuti yanokura tini, hayashande kana kurukha. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Asi zvidodaipo ndinokunyepai, kuti kana naiye Soromoni pakubhwinya kwache kwese haanai kusimidziwa fanike rimwe royakareya. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Zvino kana Mwari achisimidza zvidodai usva hwomusango, hunondovapo nasi huchidzokhandiwa mumoto hwedza, angareke nai kunyanya kukusimidzai vakaremi? Vanhu vokutenda kudiki!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Saka rekai kushushikana muchiti, ‘Tichajei’ kana kuti ‘Tichamwei’ kana kuti ‘Tichapfekei?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Ndava voyamwe marudzi vasiri vaJudha vanotsvaga zvinhu zvakarezvi zvese. Baba venyu vokudenga vanoziva kuti munozvida zvese. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Asi thangai kutsvaga umambo hwaMwari nokururama kwache, nozvakarezvi zvese zvichava zvenyu kamu. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Saka rekai kunetseka pamusoro poramangwana, ndava ramangwana richazvinetsekera rega. Rekai dambudziko rozuva rikwanirane nozuva rakarero.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Rekai Kutonga Vamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Ruka 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Rekai kutonga, kuti imipa mureke kutongewawo, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />ndava nomutongo wamunotonga nawo abiyenyu ndiwo wamuchatongewawo nawo, nomhimo yamunopima nayo ndiyo yamuchapimihwawo. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Sei uchiona kasesu kari muziso rohama yako, asi usingaone danda riri muziso rako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Kana ungati sei kuhama yako, ‘Reka ndikubise kasesu kari muziso rako’ imo muziso mako iwewe muno danda? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Iwe munyengeri, thanga wabiritsa danda riri muziso rako, ipopo uchaona mushe kubiritsa kasesu kubva muziso rohama yako. <verse eid="MAT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Rekai kupasa imbwa zvinhu zvitsvene, dzingadzochungunuka dzichikukekechurai, futi regai kukhandira humba usanga hwenyu hunokosha, ndava dzingadzohutsika tsika.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ruvirai, Tsvagai, Gugudzai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Ruka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Kumbirai, muchapasiwa, tsvagai, muchawana, gugudzai, muchazururihwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Nokuti wese anokumbira anopasiwa, noanotsvaga anowana, noanogugudza anozururihwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Ngupi munhu pakati penyu, angati kana mwanakomana wache akamukumbira zingwa, anomupasa ibhwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Kana kuti akamukumbira hove anomupasa nyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Manje kana imipa, vadoipa, muchiziva kupasa zvipo zvidonaka kuvana venyu, Baba venyu vari kudenga vachakungudzitsa peno kupasa zvinhu zvidonaka kuno avo vanovaruvira!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Saka zvese zvamunoda kuti vanhu vakuitirei imipa vaitirei zvakarezvo, ndava zvakarezvi ndizvo zvinoreva mutemo novaporofiti.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musuwo Udosvanika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Ruka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Pindai nomusuwo udosvanika, ndava musuwo udophanyuka nonzira idoreruka kutekaira inoenda pakuparadziwa, novanopinda nayo mbazinji <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Nokuti musuwo udosvanika nonzira inonetsa, inoenda kuupenyu, vanoiwana mbashoma.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muti noMichero Wawene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Ruka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Chenjererai vaporofiti vomabhwodo, vanouya kwamuri vadosimira matehwe yomahwai asi mukati yari masvitsi yanorungwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Muchavaziva nozvibereko zvavo. Mazambiringa yanothanziwaba pamwinza, kana huyu pamiti yomwinza. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Saka muti wese udonaka unobereka muchero udonaka, asi muti udoipa unobereka muchero udoipa. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Muti udonaka unoberekaba muchero udoipa, nomuti udoipa unoberekaba muchero udonaka. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Muti wese usingabereke muchero udonaka unotemewa uchikhandiwa mumoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Saka, muchavaziva nozvibereko zvavo peno.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Handinai Kana Kukuzivai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Ruka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Haasi wese anoti kwandiri, ‘Ishe, Ishe’ achapinda muumambo hwokudenga peno, asi uyo anoita kuda kwaBaba vangu vari kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Pazuva rakarero, vazinji vachati kwandiri, ‘Ishe, Ishe! Hatinai chere kuporofita muzita renyu, nokudzinga mashave muzita renyu nokuita mabasa yosimba mazinji muzita renyu!’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Ipopo ndichavadurira, ‘Handinai kukuzivai. Ibvai pano, imimi vaiti vozvidoipa.’”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvakhi Anonzeru noMuvakhi Dzemwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Ruka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Saka wese anonzva mashoko yangu yakareya achiyaita achafanana nomumhu adochenjera adovakhira imba yache paruware. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mvura idona, mafashamu yadouya, duthu ridopupuza ndokurova imba yakareyo. Asi hainai kuwa, ndava yanga idovakhihwa paruware.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Nowese anonzva mashoko yangu yakareya asingayaite achafanana nomunhu dzemwa adovakhira imba yache pajecha. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mvura idona, mafashamu yadouya, duthu ridopupuza richirova imba yakareyo, ichibva yawa. Nokuwa kwayene kudokuritsa peno!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuru hwaJesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Jesu paadopedza kunyaira kwakareku, gurusvusvu ridoshamisika nomadzidzisiro yache. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Nokuti adovadzidzisa semunhu anoukuru, asingaite kunge vanyori vavo.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Munhu ano Mabobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mariko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Ruka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Paadoburuka kubva mugomo, gurusvusvu rikuru ridomutevera. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Pakarepo munhu anomabobo adouya kwaari ndokupfugama pamberi pache achiti, “Ishe, kana muchida, munogona kundinatsa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Iye adotambanudza ruoko rache ndokumubata. Achiti kwaari, “Ndinoda, chinatsiwa.” Pakarepo mabobo yache yadobva yanatsiwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Ona kuti hapanai munhu wawanyepa chinhu, asi enda kozvinangidza kumuphirisita, wopereka chipo chidoraihwa naMozisi, chive upfakazi kuvanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Muranda woMukuru woZana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Ruka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Paanga achipinda muKaperenaume, mukuru wozana romauto adouya kumberi kwache, achimuteterera <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />achiti, “Ishe, muranda wangu adoenzera kumba ari kunetseka nonhengo idotonhora.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Zvino adoti kwaari, “Ndichauya kudzomuporesa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Asi mukuru wozana romauto adomupindura achiti, “Ishe, ndinokodzeraba kuti muuye mumba mangu. Asi ndonyairai shoko basi, muranda wangu anopora. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Ndava ndiri munhu anomasimba, ndino mauto yari pasi pangu. Ndinoti kunoumwe, ‘Enda kwakati!’ Iye woenda, ndoti kuno umwe, ‘Uya kuno!’ Iye wouya, ndinoti kumuranda wangu, ita chakati!’ Iye woita.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Jesu paadomunzva, adoshamisika ndokuti kuno vanhu vaimutevera, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, handinai kuona kutenda kudodai kunyange pakati povaIzirairi. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Ndinokunyepai, vazinji vachabva kumabvazuva nokumadokero vachigara patafura naAbhurahamu, Isaki, naJakobho muumambo hwokudenga, <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />asi vanhu voumambo vachakhandihwa murima rokunze, mavacharira vachigedageda meno yavo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Kumukuru wozana Jesu adoti, “Enda mbazviitike kwauri sekutenda kwawaita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Muranda wache achibva waporerafuti pakarepo.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Vazinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mariko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Ruka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Jesu paadopinda mumba maPita, adoona amezvara vache vadoenzera vachihwara nomuviri. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Adovabata ruoko, muviri uchibva wapora, vadosumuka pakarepo ndokumutenairira.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Mauro yakareyo, vadouya kwaari novazinji vanga vadogahwa nomashave. Iye ndokudzinga mweya yakareyo noshoko nokuporesa vese vaihwara. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Uku kwanga kuri kuzazisa zvidorehwa namuporofiti Isaya, “Adobisa hodza dzedu ndokutakura matenda yedu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanoda Kuva Vateveri vaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Ruka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Zvino Jesu paadoona gurusvusvu rikuru rovanhu ridomupoteredza, adoraira vadzidzi kuti vaende kumhiri kurimwe divi. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Ipopo munyori adouya ndokuti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, ndichakuteverai kwese kwamunoenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Zvino Jesu adoti kwaari, “Makava yanomisina, notushiri tokudenga tunousanza, asi Mwanakomana woMunhu haanai pokutsamidza musoro wache.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Umwe wovadzidzi adoti kwaari, “Ishe rekai ndithange ndaenda kovikha baba vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Asi Jesu adoti kwaari, “Nditevere, siya vadopfa vavikhe vadopfa vavo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodekhadza Duthu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mariko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Ruka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Zvino paadopinda mukamwadiya, vadzidzi vache vadomutevera. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Pakarepo duthu rikuru ridomuka pagungwa, zvokuti kamwadiya kanga kaakunyudziwa nomapfeni yomvura. Asi iye wanga adoenzera. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Vadoenda komumutsa vachiti, “Tiponesei Ishe, taakunyura!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Munochireiko imi vokutenda kudiki?” Ipopo adosumuka ndokudzuma duthu nomapfeni yogungwa, ndokubva zvarosa nokudekhara.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Varume vadoshamisika. Ndokunyairirana vachiti, “Anga munhu wakareyu mbani? Anototetekehwa noduthu nogungwa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Varume Vairi vano Mashave</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mariko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Ruka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Jesu paadosvika kumhiri kunyika yovaGarasa, adokumana novairi vanga vadopotehwa nomashave vachibva mumakuwa. Vaichisa zvokuti hapanai waipinda nonzira yakareyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Pakarepo ivo, vadodaidzira vachiti, “Munei nesu, Mwanakomana waMwari? Matouya kotidzudza nguwa isinati yasvika nai?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Zvino boka rohumba dzizinji ranga richifura padotaramukana nopakarepo. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Mashave yadomuteterera, “Kana matidzinga, tiendesei kuboka rohumba.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Iye adoti kwayari, “Endai.” Saka yadobirika yachipinda muhumba, ipopo boka rese ridotizirana kumapiripiri richichudumukira mugungwa, richimwira nhondwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Anyakabusa vadotiza, vachipinda muguta, ndokutaura zvese, nozvidoitika kuno vanga vanomashave. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Pakarepo guta rese ridobirika kokumana naJesu, pavadomuona, vadomuteterera kuti abirike mudunhu ravo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Adotonhora Nhengo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mariko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Ruka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Zvino Jesu adopinda mukamwadiya ndokuyambuka kumhiri achiuya kuguta rache. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Ipopo vadouya kwaari nomunhu adotonhora nhengo, adoenzera pabonde rache. Jesu paadoona kutenda kwavo, adoti kuno adotonhora nhengo, “Tsunga mwoyo, mwanakomana wangu! Zvitema zvako zvaregerehwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Zvino vamwe vanyori vadoti mumwoyo mavo, “Munhu wakareyu ari kushora Mwari!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Asi Jesu nokuziva pfungwa dzavo, adoti kwavari, “Seiko muchifunga zvidoipa mumwoyo yenyu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Nzvipi zvidopusa kuti, ‘Zvitema zvako zvaregerehwa,’ kana kuti, ‘Sumuka utekaire?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Asi kuti muzive kuti Mwanakomana woMunhu ano masimba panyika yokuregerera zvitema,” adobva wati kumurume adotonhora nhengo, “Sumuka, tora bonde rako, uende kumba kwako!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Iye adosumuka ndokuenda kumba kwache. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Gurusvusvu paridozviona, ridocha, richibva rarumbidza Mwari, adopereka masimba yadodaro kuvanhu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodaidza Mateo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mariko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Ruka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Jesu paadobva pakarepo achienda kumberi, adoona murume wanga adogarikika paimba yomutero, murume wacho waiitiwa Mateo. Jesu adobva wati kwaari, “Nditevere.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Iye adosumuka ndokumutevera.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Paanga adogarikika mumba kuti aje pathafura, vateresi vazinji novatadzi vadouyawo koja pabodzi naJesu novadzidzi vache. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Manje vaFarisi pavadozviona vadoti kuvadzidzi vache, “Anga indava yei mudzidzisi wenyu achija novateresi novatadzi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Asi paadozvinzva adoti kwavari, “Vapuma vanodaba chiremba, asi vanohwara ndivo vanoda chiremba. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Endai kodzidza kuti zvakarezvi zvinorevei, ‘Ndinoda tsitsi, aikona chibairo.’ Ndava ndidouyaba kudzodaidza vadorurama, asi vatadzi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo paKuzvinyima Kuja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mariko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Ruka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Ipopo vadzidzi vaJohwani Muombeki vadouya kwaari vachiti, “Sei isisu novaFarisi tichitsanya, asi vadzidzi venyu vasingatsanye?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Zvino Jesu adoti kwavari, “Ko vadokokewa pamuchato vangarire iye mukwende vanaye chere? Mazuva yachauya pachabiritsiwa mukwende kubva pakati pavo, ipopo ndipo pavachadzotsanya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Hapanai anosonerera chigamba chitsva pahembe yokare peno, ndava chigamba chitsva chinomwaura hembe, boo roingidzika kukura. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Nowaini itsva inoisiwaba muhomwe yogako rokare, ukaita zvakarezvo homwe yogakoyo inophabuka, waini yotaika, nohomwe yodehweyo yoparara. Asi waini itsva inoisiwa muhomwe yogako ritsva, kuti zvese zvichengeteke.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanasikana woMutungamiri noMukadzi Adobata Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mariko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Ruka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Achiri kunyaira kwavari daipo, padobva pauya mutungamiri achipfugama pamberi pache, achiti, “Mwanasikana wangu wapfa, asi uyai muturike ruoko renyu paari, kuti achire.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Jesu novadzidzi vache adosumuka ndokumutevera.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Zvino mukadzi wanga watambura nokubirika gazi kwomakore gumi nomairi adouya mumasure mache ndokubata mukombero wojasi rache, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />ndava adoti mumwoyo mache, “Ndikandobata jasi rache basi, ndichapora.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Jesu adochununguka, paadomuona adoti, “Tsunga mwoyo mwanasikana, kutenda kwako kwakuporesa.” Pakarepo, mukadzi adobva wapora.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Jesu paadosvika kumba kwomutungamiri, achiona vanoridza tumukubwe, nogurusvusvu richirira maundu, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />adoti kwavari, “Birikai, ndava musikana haanai kupfa, wandoenzera.” Asi ivo vadomuseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Asi padodzobiritsiwa gurusvusvu, adopinda ndokubata ruoko rache, musikana achibva wamuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Hwenye hwakarehwo hudosvika mumatunhu yakareyo yese.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Mapofu Mairi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Zvino Jesu achipfuurira kubva pakarepo, mapofu mairi yadomutevera, yachidaidziritsa, “Mwanakomana waDhavhiti, tinzvirei tsitsi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Paadopinda mumba, mapofu yadouya kwaari, zvino Jesu adoti kwayari, “Munotenda nai kuti ndinokona kuita zvakarezvi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Vadoti kwaari, “Inde, Ishe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Ipopo adobata meso yavo, achiti, “Maererano nokutenda kwenyu mbazviitiwe kwamuri.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Meso yavo yadopenya ndokuona. Jesu adovatsindikiritsa, “Onai kuti hapanai wazviziva.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Asi vadoenda vachiparadzira hwenye hwakarehwo mumatunhu yese.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume Wanga ari Chimumumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Pavanga vaakubirika, chimumumu changa chinoshave chidoisiwa kwaari. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Padodzingiwa shave, chimumumu chidotaura, gurusvusvu ridoshamisika richiti, “Zvidodaizvi hazvinati zvaoneka muIzirairi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Asi vaFarisi vadoti, “Anodzinga mashave nomukuru womashave.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoitira Vanhu Mutsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Jesu adotenderera mumaguta nomumisha yese. Adodzidzisa mumasinagoge yavo, futi achiparidza vhangeri roumambo, adoporesa matenda yese nohodza dzese. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Paadoona gurusvusvu, adorinzvira mutsa, ndava raidzungaidziwa pasinai chibatsiro, kunge hwai dzisinai nyakabusa. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ipopo adoti kuvadzidzi vache, “Kukohwa nghukuru, asi vashandi mbashoma, <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />namatai ndipo kuti mwenekachiro wokukohwa atume vashandi pagoho rache.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Nhumwa Gumi noVairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mariko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Ruka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Zvino adodaidza vadzidzi vache gumi novairi ndokuvapasa masimba pamusoro pomweya idoipa, kuti vaidzinge, nokuporesa matenda yese nohodza dzese. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Mazita yonhumwa gumi novairi njaya, wokuthanga ndiSimoni anoitiwa Pita naAndireya waiva mukoma nomunin'ina naye, naJakobho waiva mukoma nomunin'ina’ina naJohwani, vaiva vanakomana vaZebhedhiya, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />naFiripi naBhatoromiyu, naTomasi naMateo muteresi, naJakobho mwanakomana waArifiyasi, naThedhiyasi, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />naSimoni woushingi, naJudhasi Sikariyoti, adodzomupandukira.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basa rovanoGumi noVairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mariko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Ruka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Ivova gumi novairi Jesu adovatuma, achivakohomedza, “Musaende kunovasiri vaJudha, futi rekai kupinda muguta rovaSamariya, <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />asi endai kuhwai dzidotaika dzoimba yaIzirairi. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Pamunenge muchienda paridzai muchiti, ‘Umambo hwokudenga hwanyedza papfupi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Poresai vahwere, mutsai vadopfa, natsai vomabobo, dzingai mashave. Mudopasiwa mahara, perekai mahara. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Rekai kutora ndarama kana sirivha, kana mhangura muzvikwama zvenyu, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />pahwendo hwenyu pasave nonhava, pasave nohembe dziiri, kana shangu, kana tsvimbo, ndava mushandi ano kodzero yochokuja chache.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Futi guta kana musha upi zvawene wamunopinda, tsvagai kuti mbani anokodzera kugara nemi makaremo, garai naiyeyo kusvikira mabirika. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pamunenge muchipinda muimba, moresai vari makaremo. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Kana imba yacho ichikodzera, rugare hwenyu mbahuuye pavari, asi kana isingakodzere, rugare hwenyu mbahudzokere kwamuri. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Pakaita asingakutambirei kana asingatetekere mashoko yenyu, pamunobirika mumusha wakareyo kana muguta rakarero kuhumurai pfumbi patsoka dzenyu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, pazuva rokutongewa, zvichatorerukira nyika yoSodhoma noGomora kukunda guta rakarero.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutambudziwa Kunouya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mariko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Ruka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Onai, ndinokutumai mudoita kunge mahwai pakati pomasvitsi. Chenjerai kunge nyoka futi muve vasinai mhosva kunge njiva. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Chenjererai vanhu, ndava vachakuperekai kumatare, nokukurovai mumasinagoge yavo, <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />muchangwuvihwa kuvatongi nomadzimambo nokuda kwangu, kuti mupfakaze pamberi povasiri vaJudha. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Kana vachikuperekai kuvatongi, regai kunetseka kuti muchataura tini kana kuti muchati chii, ndava zvamuchanyaira muchazvipasiwa panguwa yakareyo. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Ndava ndimiba munonyaira, asi Mweya waBaba venyu anotaura nomamuri.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Mukoma nomunin'ina vachabaisana, nababa mwana wavo, vana vachamukira vabereki vachivabaisa, <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />futi muchavengewa novese nokuda kwangu. Asi anotsungirira kusvika kumagumo achaponesewa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Kana vakakutambudzai murimwe guta, tizirai kuno rimwe, nokuti chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, munopedzaba maguta yese yaIzirairi, Mwanakomana woMunhu asinati wauya.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mudzidzi haakunde mudzidzisi wache, nomuranda haazi pamusoro patenzi wache. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Zvinokodzera kuti mudzidzi afanane nomudzidzisi wache, nomuranda kuti afanane natenzi wache. Kana vadodaidza tenzi woimba kuti Bheruzabheri, vachakungudza zvidonyanyitsa tini kunyangadzira voimba yache!”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anofanira Kuchiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Ruka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Saka rekai kuvacha. Ndava hapanai chidofukidziwa chisingadzobiritsiwa pachenu, kana chidosvisviwa chisingadzozikana. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Zvandinokunyepai murima, zvinyairei pachiedza, nozvamunonzva kazevezeve zvidaidzirei pamusoro podzimba. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Rekai kucha vanobaya muiri asi vasingagone kubaya mweya, asi ichai uyo anogona kuparadza zvese muiri nomweya mugehena. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ko tusudzamvura tuiri tunotengesewaba nosendi? Asi hapanai kabodzi kanodzowira pasi Baba venyu vasingade. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Asi kana novhudzi romusoro wenyu ridoverengewa rese. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Rekai kucha ndipo, mudokosha kukunda tusudzamvura tuzinji.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubvuma kana Kuramba Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8">Ruka 12:8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Saka wese anondibvuma pamberi povanhu, ndichamubvumawo pamberi paBaba vangu vari kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />asi wese anondiramba pamberi povanhu ndichamurambawo pamberi paBaba vangu vari kudenga.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aikona Runyararo asi Botso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Ruka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14:26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Rekai kufunga kuti ndidouya kudzoisa runyararo panyika, handinai kuuya kudzoisa runyararo, asi botso. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Nokuti ndidouya kuti munhu atsvatsvane nababa vache, mwanasikana apesane namaache, nomuroora apesane naamwene vache, <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />mhandu dzomunhu ndidzo dzichava hama dzomumba mache.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Uyo anoda baba kana amai kukunda inini haakodzere kwandiri, nouyo anoda mwanakomana kana mwanasikana kukunda inini haakodzere kwandiri, <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />nouyo asingatore muchinjikwa wache achinditevera haakodzere kwandiri. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Uyo anoda kuchidza upenyu hwache achataikihwa nahwo, nouyo anotaikihwa noupenyu hwache nokuda kwangu achahuwana.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mibairo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mariko 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Anokutambirai anotambira inini, noanonditambira inini anotambirawo adondituma. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Anotambira muporofiti nondava yokuti muporofiti achatambira mubairo womuporofiti, noanotambira munhu adorurama nondava yokuti munhu adorurama achatambira mubairo womunhu adorurama. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Futi wese anopasa umwe wovadiki ava kana mukombe zvawene womvura inotonhora nondava yokuti mudzidzi, chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, anodzosayaba mubairo wache.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Nhume dzaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Ruka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Jesu paadopedza kuraira vadzidzi vache gumi novairi, adobva pakarepo ndokuenda kodzidzisa nokuparidza mumaguta yavo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Johwani paanga ari mutorongo adonzva zvomabasa yaKhirisitu, adobva watuma vadzidzi vache kobvunza Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Ivo vadomubvunza vachiti, “Ndimi chere waidzouya, kana kuti kuri kuuya umwe?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Endai konyepa Johwani zvamuri kunzva nozvamuri kuona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />zvokuti marombe yari kuona, vadotonhora nhengo vari kutekaira, vanomabobo vari kunatsiwa, nomaburunzeve yari kunzva, vadopfa vari kumutsiwa, novarombo vari kuparidzihwa nyaya idonaka. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Adokomborehwa asingagumbuhwe nainini!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Pavanga vachienda, Jesu adothanga kunyaira kumhomho pamusoro paJohwani achiti, “Chii chamudoenda koona kusango? Mudoenda koona tsanga yaigwetedzewa nomhepo chere? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Saka mudoendereiko kusango? Mudoenda koona munhu adosimira hembe dzinodhura chere? Handiti vanosimira hembe dzinodhura vari mudzimba dzomadzimambo! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Saka mudoenderei? Koona muporofiti chere? Inde, ndinokunyepai kuti anokunda muporofiti. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Wakareyu ndiye adonyohwa nozvache kuti, ‘Ona, ndinotuma nhume yangu pamberi pako achakunhadzirira nzira.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri pakati povadozvahwa novanhukadzi hapanai anokurira Johwani Muombeki. Asi mudikidiki muumambo hwokudenga, mukuru kwaari. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kubva pamazuva yaJohwani Muombeki kusvika zvino umambo hwokudenga huri kuhwisiwa, vanomanira vari kuhutora zvombabvu. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Nokuti vaporofiti vese nomutemo vadoporofita kusvikira pana Johwani, <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />futi kana muchida kuzvitambira, ndiye Eriya wanga achidzouya. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Anonzeve, mbaatetekere anzve!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Asi vanhu vonguwa ino ndingavafananidze nochii? Vadofanana novana vadogarikika pamisika, vachidaidzira kuno vavanotamba navo vachiti, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Tidokuridzirai chinonje, asi hamunai kutamba, tidoridza mhere asi hamunai kurira!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ndava Johwani adouya asingaje, futi asingamwe, ivo ndokuti, ‘Anoshave!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwanakomana woMunhu adouya achija nokumwa, ivo vadoti, ‘Onai, nyanhafu nomuraradzi, shamwari yovateresi novatadzi!’ Asi uchenjeri hunoruramisiwa nozviito zvahwene.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maguta yasinai Kutenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Ruka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ipopo adothanga kudzuma maguta maadonyanya kuita mabasa yache yosimba, ndava havanai kupinduka. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Nhamu kwauri Korozini! Nhamu kwauri, Bhetisaidha! Ndava mabasa yosimba yadoitiwa mamuri dai yadoitiwa muThire noSidhoni, dai vadonangidza kupinduka kwavo nokusimira hembe dzomasaga nokuzvikupira rota. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Asi ndinokunyepai, pazuva rokutongewa zvichatoredzera zvidonyanya kuTire noSidhoni pana imimi. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Naiwepa Kaperenaume, uchakwiridzihwa kusvika kudenga nai? Neye uchaderedzewa kusvika muGehena. Nokuti mabasa yosimba yadoitiwa mauri, dai yadoitiwa muSodhoma, ringadai richiripo kusvika nasi. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Asi ndinokunyepa kuti, pazuva rokutongewa zvichanyanya kutoredzera kunyika yoSodhoma pana iwepa.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uyai Kwandiri Muzorore</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21">Ruka 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Panguwa yakareyo Jesu adotaura, “Ndinokutendai Baba, Ishe wokudenga nonyika, kuti mudohwanza zvinhu izvi kuno vadochenjera novanonzvitsitsa, muchizvizururira kuvana. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Inde, Baba ndava kwakareko ndiko kuda kwenyu.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Zvinhu zvese ndidozvipasiwa naBaba vangu, futi hapanai anoziva Mwanakomana kunze kwaBaba, hapanaiwo anoziva Baba kunze kwoMwanakomana nokuno uyo Mwanakomana waanosarudza kuzururira.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Uyai kwandiri, imipa mese mudoneta nokuchokwa nomitoro, ndichakupasai zororo. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Takurai joki rangu, mudzidze kubva kwandiri, nokuti ndidopfava uye ndino mwoyo unozvininipisa, ipopo muchawanira mweya yenyu zororo. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Ndava joki rangu ridopusa, nomutoro wangu udoreruka.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo pamusoro poSabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mariko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Ruka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Panguwa yakareyo Jesu adopinda nomuminda yogorosi iri Sabata. Vadzidzi vache vanga vaanonzara, vadobva vathanga kuchora hora dzogorosi vachija. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Asi vaFarisi pavadozviona, vadoti kwaari, “Onaka, vadzidzi vako varikuita zvisingatendehwe kuitiwa paSabata!”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Adoti kwavari, “Hamunai kuverenga nai zvidoitiwa naDhavhiti paanga anonzara novanhu vaanga anavo? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Adopinda muimba yaMwari, achija pabodzi novanhu vaanga anavo mazingwa yanoera, yasingabvumihwi kujiwa noumwe munhu kusiya kwokujiwa novaphirisita basi. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Kana kuti hamunai kuverenga mumutemo masvipisihwo yanoitiwa Sabata novaphirisita muimba yaMwari, asi vasinai mhosva? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Ndinokunyepai, mukuru kukunda imba yaMwari ari pano. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Dai maiziva kuti zvakarezvi zvinorevei, ‘Ndinoda tsitsi, aikona chibairo.’ Mungadai musinai kupasa mhosva vasinai mhosva, <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />nokuti Mwanakomana woMunhu ndiShe woSabata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murume ano Ruoko Rudoputana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mariko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Ruka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Adobva pakarepo ndokupinda musinagoge ravo, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />makaremo manga muno munhu anoruoko ridoputana. Zvino vadomubvunza vachiti, “Zvinobvumihwa chere kuporesa nomusi woSabata?” Vadonyaira zvakarezvo kuti vawane mhosva yokumunenedzera.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mbani munhu pamuri, anoti kana hwai rache rawira mugomba noSabata, haaribati achiribiritsa? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Munhu adotonyanyitsa kukosha kukunda mahwai! Saka zvinotendehwa kuita zvidonaka nomusi woSabata.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ipopo adoti kumurume uye, “Tambanudza ruoko rako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Iye adobva waritambanudza, ndokubva rapora, kutofanana norimwe racho. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Asi vaFarisi vadobirika vachienda korangana, mabairo yavangamuite.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muranda Adosaruhwa naMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Jesu achiziva zvakarezvi adobirika pakarepo, vanhu vazinji vadomutevera. Adovaporesa vese <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />achivatsindikira kuti vareke kutaura kuti iye mbani. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Uku kwanga kuri kuzazisa zvidorehwa nomuporofiti Isaya:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Onai muranda wangu wandidosarura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">mudikani wangu anofadza mweya wangu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Ndichaisa Mweya wangu paari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">iye achazivisa voDzimwe Ndudzi kururamisa.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Anopopotaba kana kufurumidza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">hapanai achanzva dzinga rache munzira,<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />tsanga idobvonyewa anoichoraba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">kana kudzima kathambo kadonyekuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">kusvikira aita kuti kururamisira kukunde,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />futi muzita rache ndimo muchava notariro yovasiri vaJudha.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naBheruzabhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mariko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Ruka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Zvino vadouya kwaari nowanga ano shave ari bofu nochimumumu, iye ndokumuporesa, zvokuti chimumumu chidotaura nokuona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Vanhu vese vadoshamisika, vachibva vati, “Anga iyeyu angave Mwanakomana waDhavhiti nai?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Asi vaFarisi pavadozvinzva vadoti, “NdiBheruzabhu chete, jinda romashave, raanodzinga naro mashave murume uyu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Nokuziva pfungwa dzavo, adoti kwavari, “Umambo hwese hunozvipesanisa hunopfuruka, futi hapanai guta kana imba ingamire kana ichizvipesanisa, <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />naSathani kana achidzinga Sathani, ari kutozvipesanisa, saka umambo hwache hunomiraba. <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Zvino kana Bheruzabhu ari iye wandinodzinga naye mashave, ko vanakomana venyu vanoyadzinga naani? Saka vachava vatongi venyu ndipo. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Asi kana uri Mweya waMwari wandinodzinga nawo mashave, kureva kuti umambo hwaMwari hwauya pamuri.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Kana kuti munhu angapinde tini mumba momunhu anomasimba achipamba midziyo yache, kunze kwokunge wathanga kusunga nyamasimbayo? Ipopo ndipo peno paangadzopamba imba yache.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Uyo asiri pabodzi nainini anopesana nainini, noasingaunganidze nainini anopamwadza. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Nokudaro ndinokunyepai, vanhu vachakangamwihwa zvitadzo zvese nokushora, asi kushora Mweya hakukangamwihwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Futi wese anonyaira shoko rinopikisa Mwanakomana woMunhu achakangamwihwa, asi anonyaira shoko rinopikisa Mweya Mutsvene haakangamwihwe, munguwa ino kana inouya.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuziva Muti noMuchero Wawene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Ruka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Muti udonaka nomuchero wawene udonaka, muti udoipa nomuchero wawene udoipa, ndava muti unozikana nomuchero wawene. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Imi vana vonyoka mungataure tini zvidonaka, imimi mudoipa? Ndava muromo unotaura zvizere mumwoyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Munhu adonaka kubva mupfuma yache idonaka anobiritsa zvidonaka, nomunhu adoipa kubva mupfuma yache idoipa anobiritsa zvidoipa.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Ndinokuudzai, pazuva rokutongewa vanhu vachazvidairira pamusoro poshoko rese rokusafunga ravadotaura, <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />ndava nomashoko yako ucharuramisiwa, uye nomashoko yako uchataiwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupopera Chiratidzo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mariko 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 8:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Ruka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Zvino vamwe vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi vadoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi tinoda kuona chiratidzo kubva kwamuri.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Asi iye adovapindura achiti, “Vanhu vomazuvano vadoipa vasinai kutendeka vanotsvaga chiratidzo: manje hapanai chiratidzo chavachapasiwa kunze kwochiratidzo chomuporofiti Jona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ndava sezvo Jona adogara mumimba mohove mazuva matatu nousiku hutatu, noMwanakomana woMunhu achavawo mumwoyo wonyika mazuva matatu nousiku hutatu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Vanhu vomuNinivhi vachasumuka pakutongewa vachipasa mhosva vanhu vonguwa ino, ndava vadopinduka pakuparidza kwaJona, onai, umwe mukuru kuna Jona ari pano. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Mambokadzi wokuChamhembe kunyika yoShebha achasumuka pakutongwa achipasa mhosva vanhu vonguwa ino, ndava adouya kubva kumagumo yonyika kudzonzva uchenjeri hwaSoromoni, onai, umwe mukuru kuna Soromoni ari pano.”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudzoka kwoShave</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Ruka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Kana mweya udoipa wabirika mumunhu, unopinda nomunzvimbo dzisinai mvura uchitsvaga zororo, asi unorisaya. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Ipopo unoti, ‘Ndichadzokera kuimba yangu yandidobirika.’ Paunouya unowana imba isinai chinhu, idotsvaihwa, idonhadzihwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Zvino unoenda wouya noimwe mweya idoipa minomwe idoipitsitsa kuukunda, yopinda kogara makaremo. Mamiriro yokupedzisira yomunhu wakareyo yadonyangaritsa kukunda yokuthanga. Izvozvo ndizvo zvichaitika kuvanhu vonguwa ino vadoipa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amai novanin'ina vaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mariko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Ruka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Achiri kunyaira novanhu daipo amaache novanin'ina’ina vache vadomira panze, vachikumbira kunyaira naye. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ipopo umwe adomunyepa achiti, “Amai venyu novanin'ina’ina venyu vadokumirirai panze, vari kuda kukuonai.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Kumunhu adomunyepa Jesu adopindura achiti, “Amaangu mbani? Vanin'ina vangu mbani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Adotambanudza ruoko kuvadzidzi vache ndokuti, “Vakareva ndivo amaangu novanin'ina’ina vangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Ndava wese anoita kuda kwaBaba vangu vari kudenga ndiye munin'ina wangu, nohanzvadzi yangu, namaangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMujari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mariko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Ruka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Pazuva ribodzibodziro Jesu adobirika mumba achienda kogara panyasi pogungwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Gurusvusvu rikuru ridoungana kwaari zvokutoti adodzopinda mukamwadiya ndokugarikika makaremo, gurusvusvu rese ridomira kumhera kwogungwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Adovanyepa zvinhu zvidowanda nomifananidzo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">Adoti kwavari, “Mujari adoenda kojara mbeu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Paanga achijara, dzimwe mbeu dzidombwerera munzira, tushiri tudouya ndokudzija. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Dzimwe mbeu dzidombwerera pamabhwe, padzidosaya ivhu ridowanda. Dzidobva dzamera nokamangu, nokuti ivhu ranga riri rishoma. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Asi zuva paridobirika, dzidotsva, futi nondava yokuti mudzi yadzene yanga isinai kudzika pasi, dzidouna ndokuoma. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Dzimwe mbeu dzidombwerera panomwinza, mwinza idokura ndokudzivhinga. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Dzimwe mbeu dzidombwerera paivhu ridonaka, ndokubereka zvibereko, zvimwe zvidopetewa kazana, zvimwe zvidopetewa makumi matanhatu, zvimwewo zvidopetewa makumi matatu.<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Anonzeve, mbaatetekere anzve!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvinangwa zvoMifananidzo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mariko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Ruka 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ipopo vadzidzi vadouya ndokuti kwaari, “Munonyairireiko kwavari nomifananidzo?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Adovapindura achiti, “Imimi mudopasiwa kuti muzive zvidohwanda zvoumambo hwokudenga, asi ivo havanai kupasiwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Ndava kuno anazvo achapasiwa zvidowanda, wova nozvizinji, asi asinai nochaanofungacho kuti anacho achatorehwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ndicho chikonzero ndichivanyairira nomifananidzo ndava vanoona, vasingaonetsetse, vanonzva, asi vasinganzvitsitse, futi havanzvitsitse. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Pavari kuporofita kwaIsaya kuri kuzazisiwa kunoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Kunzva muchanzva asi musinganzvitsitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">futi kuona muchaona asi musingaonetsetse,<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />nokuti mwoyo yovanhu vakareva yatindivara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nonzeve dzavo dzaneta kunzva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">futi vatsinzina meso yavo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Zvidoitihwa kuti varege kudzoonetsetsa nomeso yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nokunzva nonzeve dzavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nokunzvitsitsa nomwoyo wavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">kuti vatendeukire kwandiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kuti ndivaporese.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Asi meso yenyu yadokomborehwa, ndava yanoona, nonzeve dzenyu dzidokomborehwa ndava dzinonzva. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, vaporofiti vazinji novadorurama vazinji vaiditsitsa kuona zvamunoona, asi havanai kuzviona nokunzva zvamunonzva, asi vadozvinzvaba.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotsumbudzura Mufananidzo woMujari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mariko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Ruka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Chinzvai manje mufananidzo womujari. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Kana munhu akanzva shoko roumambo asi asingarinzvitsitse, adoipa anouya achibvuta chidojariwa mumwoyo mache, yakarei ndiyo mbeu idombwerera munzira. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Dzidombwerera pamabhwe nguye anonzva shoko woritambira nokamangu nomufaro. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Asi kana asinai midzi maari, anotsungirira kwokanguwa kapfupi. Saka panouya nhamu kana kutambudziwa nokuda kwoshoko, anowa nokamangu. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Mbeu idombwerera mumwinza nguye anonzva shoko, asi nokuda kwohanya yozvonyika nokufarira upfumi zvinovhunga shoko, rotadza kuva nozvibereko. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Asi mbeu idombwerera paivhu ridonaka nguye anonzva shoko worinzvitsitsa, wobereka zvibereko, zvidopetewa kazana, imwe makumi matanhatu, imwewo makumi matatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woSora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Jesu adoisa umwe mufananidzo pamberi pavo achiti, “Umambo hwokudenga hungafananidziwe nomunhu adojara mbeu idonaka mumunda wache, <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />asi vanhu pavanga vadoenzera, mhandu yache idouya ndokujara sora mukati mogorosi, ndokuenda. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Saka zvirimwa pazvidomera zvichibereka zvibereko, sora ridoonekawo. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Vashandi vomwenekachiro woimba vadouya kwaari vachiti, ‘Tenzi, handiti mudojara mbeu idonaka mumunda menyu, ko sei madzomera sora?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Iye adoti kwavari, ‘Mhandu ndiyo idoita izvozvi.’ Vashandi vadoti kwaari, ‘Saka munoda chere kuti tiende koridzura?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Asi iye adoti, ‘Neye, pamunenge muchidzura sora mungadzuririre kubodzi nogorosi. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Zvirekei zvikurire pabodzi kusvikira pakukohwa. Panguwa yokukohwa ndichaudza vakohwi kuti vathange kuunganidza sora, vorisunga mumisumbu kuti ripisiwe, vodzounganidza gorosi vachiriisa muchitura changu.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMbeu yomasitadhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mariko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Ruka 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Umwe mufananidzo adoisa pamberi pavo, achiti, “Umambo hwokudenga hudoita kunge kambeu kadikidiki komastadhi kadotohwa nomunhu ndokukajara mumunda mache. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Iko kadiki pambeu dzese, asi pakanokura ndiko kanokunda zvirimwa zvomudimba kanotodzoita muti, zvokuti tushiri tomudenga tunouya tuchiita usanza hwatene mumathai yawene.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMbiriso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20">Ruka 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Jesu adovanyepa umwe mufananidzo achiti, “Umambo hwokudenga hunenge mbiriso idotohwa nomukadzi achiidira muzviyero zvitatu zvofurau, kusvikira yafufumisa mukanyiwa wese.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushandisa Mifananidzo kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mariko 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Zvese izvi Jesu adozvinyaira kugurusvusvu zviri mumifananidzo, futi hapanai chaadovanyepa chisiri mumufananidzo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Uku kwanga kuri kuzazisa zvidorehwa nomuporofiti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ndichashamisa muromo wangu mumifananidzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Ndichanyaira zvidohwanziwa kubva pakusikiwa kwonyika.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotsumbudzura Mufananidzo woSora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Ipopo adosiya gurusvusvu achibva wapinda mumba. Zvino vadzidzi vache vadouya kwaari vachiti, “Titsumbudzurirei zvinoreva mufananidzo wosora mumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Adopindura achiti, “Anojara mbeu idonaka ndiye Mwanakomana woMunhu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />munda ndiyo nyika, mbeu idonaka inoreva vanakomana voumambo, sora ndivo vanakomana vajabhurosi, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />mhandu idovajara ndijabhurosi, kukohwa ndiko kuguma kwonyika, vakohwi ingirozi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Sekuunganidziwa kunoitiwa sora richipisiwa nomoto, ndizvo zvichaitika pakuguma kwonyika. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwanakomana woMunhu achatuma ngirozi dzache, dzichaunganidza kubva muumambo hwache zvese zvinokonzera chitadzo novaiti vozvidoipa vese, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />dzichavakhandira mubimbimbi romoto, makaremo vanhu vacharira nokugedageda meno yavo. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ipopo vadorurama vachapenya kunge zuva muumambo hwaBaba vavo. Anonzeve, mbaatetekere anzve!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woPfuma Idosvisviwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Umambo hwokudenga hunenge pfuma idosvisviwa mukati momunda, idodzowaniwa nomunhu achibva waifuchira, zvino nomufaro wache adoenda ndokutengesa zvese zvaanga anazvo achitenga munda wakareyo.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woParera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Pakare umambo hwokudenga hudoita kunge munhu womaronda ari kutsvaga usanga hudonakitsitsahwo, <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />iye adoti wawana usanga hudokoshetsa, adoenda ndokutengesa zvese zvaanga anazvo achibva wahutenga.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMambure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Pakare umambo hwokudenga hudoita kunge mambure yadokhandiwa mugungwa yachibva yajorera hove dzomarudzi yese, <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />payadozara, vanhu vadoyadhonzera kunze ndokugarikika pasi vachikamura dzidonaka vachidziisa mumidziyo asi vachitaya dzidoipa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Saka zvakarezvo ndizvo zvichaitika pakuguma kwonguwa. Ngirozi dzichabuda dzichikamura vadoipa kubva pano vadorurama, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />dzichivakhandira muvira romoto, makaremo vanhu vacharira nokugedageda meno yavo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chokwadi Chitsva noChokare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />“Izvozvi zvese mazvinzvitsitsa chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Vadoti kwaari, “Inde.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Uye adoti kwavari, “Saka mudzidzisi wese womutemo adodzidzisiwa zvoumambo hwokudenga adoita kunge mwenekachiro woimba anobiritsa kubva papfuma yache zvitsva nozvitsaru.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorambiwa paNazareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mariko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Ruka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Jesu paadopedza mifananidzo yakarei, adobirika kubva pakarepo. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />achiuya muguta rache adovadzidzisa musinagoge ravo, zvokuti vadoshamisika, vachiti, “Anga munhu iyeyu adowana poi uchenjeri ihwohu nomabasa iyoya yosimba? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Anga wakareyu mwanakomanaba womuvezi nai? Amai vache vanoitiwaba Mariya, novanin'ina vache havasi Jakobho, naJosefa, naSimoni, naJudhasi chere? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Nohanzvadzi dzache dzese hadzisi pano chere? Saka nghupi kwaadowana zvesezvi munhu iyeyu?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Vadobva vaita chisembu naye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Asi Jesu adoti kwavari, “Muporofiti haasaye kukudziwa kusiya kwomuguta rache nomumba mache basi.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Haanai kudzoita mabasa yosimba yadowanda makaremo, nondava yokusatenda kwavo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kubaiwa kwaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mariko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Ruka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Panguwa yakareyo Herudhe mutongi adonzva runyerekupe raJesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />achibva wati kuvaranda vache, “NdiJohwani Muombeki wakareyu, adomuka kuvadopfa, ndochikonzero masimba yominana aya yari kushanda maari.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Nokuti Herudhe wanga wabata Johwani ndokumusunga achimuisa mutorongo, nondava yaHerodhiyasi, mukadzi womukoma wache Firipi, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />nokuti Johwani waigara achiti kwaari, “Hazvisi pamutemo kwauri kuti ave wako.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Kana zvache Herudhe waida kubaya Johwani, waicha vanhu, ndava vaimutora semuporofiti.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Asi zuva rokuzvahwa kwaHerudhe paridosvika, mwanasikana waHerodhiyasi adotamba pamberi pochita chovanhu, zvidofadza Herudhe, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />zvokuti adovimbisa nomhiko kwaari kuti anomupasa chese chaangakumbire.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Wafurihwa namaache, adoti, “Ndipasei ipopano musoro waJohwani Muombeki uri mumbenge.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mambo adoita urombo nazvo, asi nondava yomhiko yache novarendo vache adoraira kuti aitihwe chikumbiro chache, <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />adotumira kuti Johwani agwatiwe musoro mutorongo, <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />musoro wache udouyisiwa uri mumbenge uchibva wapasiwa musikana, iye ndokuuendesa kuna amai vache. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Vadzidzi vaJohwani vadouya vachitora mutumbi wache ndokuuviga, vachibva vaenda koudza Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoposha Zviuru Zvishano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Ruka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Johwani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Zvino Jesu paadonzva zvidoitika, adobirika pakarepo ari mukamwadiya achienda kunzvimbo yache wega. Asi gurusvusvu paridozvinzva, ridomutevera notsoka richibva mumaguta. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Jesu paadobirika mukamwadiya achiona gurusvusvu, adorinzvira tsitsi, ndokuporesa vanga vachihwara.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Yava mauro, vadzidzi vadouya kwaari vachiti, “Muno musango, zuva radoka, kototsai vanhu vaende kumisha kozvitengera zvokuja.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Jesu adoti, “Havafaniri kuenda, imimi vapasei zvokuja zvacho.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Vadoti kwaari, “Pano tinondova nomazingwa mashano nohove dziiri basi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Iye adoti, “Uyai nazvo kuno kwandiri.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ipopo adoraira gurusvusvu kuti rigarikike pasi pausva, adotora mazingwa mashano nohove dziiri ndokunangara kudzuru, achizvikomborera, adozvikomora ndokuzvipasa vadzidzi vache, vadzidzi ndokuzvipasa gurusvusvu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Vese vadoja vachiguta. Vadodzounganidza zvimepfu zvidosara ndokuzaza tsvanda gumi nodziiri. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Vadoja vacho vaisvika zviuru zvishano zvovanhurume, pasingaverengewe vanhukadzi novana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotekaira Pamusoro poMvura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mariko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Johwani 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Pakarepo Jesu adoita kuti vadzidzi vache vapinde mukamwadiya vamuthangire kuenda kumhiri, iye ndokusara achikototsa gurusvusvu rovanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Wapedza kukototsa zvaunga, adokwira mugomo ari wega konamata. Yava mauro, wanga ari wega makaremo, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />asi panguwa yakarei kamwadiya kanga katoita huri kubva panyika, kachitadzisiwa nomasaisai, ndava duthu raihwisana navo.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kwaakuchena adouya kwavari, achitekaira pagungwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Asi vadzidzi pavadomuona achitekaira pamusoro pomvura mugungwa, vadocha vachiti, “Nyhipoko!” vadobva varidza mhere nokucha.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Asi nokamangu adonyaira kwavari achiti, “Batai hana, ndini, rekai kucha.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Zvino Pita adomupindura, “Ishe kana muri imimi, ndiudzei ndiuye kwamuri pamusoro pomvura.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Adoti, “Uya.” Ipopo Pita adobva wabirika mukamwadiya achitekaira pamusoro pomvura kuuya kuna Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Asi paadoona mhepo, adocha, ndokuthanga kunyura achibva wadaidzira achiti, “Ishe ndiponesei.”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Nokamangu Jesu adotambanudza ruoko rache ndokumubata, achiti kwaari, “Naiwe nyakutenda kudiki, watsakidzireiko?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Pavadopinda mukamwadiya, duthu ridorosa. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Vaiva mukamwadiya vadomunamata vachiti, “Chokwadi muri Mwanakomana waMwari.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Vahwere muGenasareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mariko 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Pavanga vayambuka, vadosvika munyika yoGenasareti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Vanhu vomunzvimbo yakareyo pavadomuziva, vadotuma shoko mudunhu rese vachibva vauya kwaari novese vaihwara, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />vachimuteterera kuti vandobata mukombero wojasi rache basi, futi vese vadoribata vadoporesewa.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Tsika dzoVakuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mariko 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Zvino vaFarisi novadzidzisi vomurairo vadouya kuna Jesu vachibva kuJerusarema, vachiti, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Seiko vadzidzi venyu vasingatevere tsika dzovakuru? Ndava vanoshambaba manja yavo kana vaakuja.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Adovapindura, “Ko sei imimi muchichora mutemo waMwari nokuda kwotsika dzenyu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ndava Mwari adoraira achiti, ‘Kudza Baba vako naamai vako,’ uye ‘Uyo anotaura zvidobookera kuna baba kana amai vache, mbaapunziwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Asi imimi munoti, ‘Kana munhu akaudza baba vache kana amai vache, kuti chandaida kukubatsirai nacho chapasiwa Mwari. <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Iye achafaniraba kukudza baba vache nacho, saka nondava yotsika dzenyu, mudosayisa simba shoko raMwari. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Imi vanyengeri! Isaya adonatsa paadoporofita pamusoro penyu, achiti:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />Vanhu ava vanondikudza nomiromo yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">asi mwoyo wavo uri kurefu nainini,<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />hapanai zvokuti vanondinamata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">dzidziso dzavo mitemo yovanhu.’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvinosvipisa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mariko 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Zvino Jesu adodaidza vanhu kwaari ndokuti kwavari, “Inzvai, munzvitsitse: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />hapanai chinopinda mukamwa chinosvipisa munhu, asi chinobirika mukamwa, chakarecho ndicho chinosvipisa munhu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ipopo vadzidzi vadouya ndokuti kwaari, “Muri kuziva chere kuti vaFarisi vadogumbuka pavadonzva kunyaira kwakareku?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Adopindura achiti, “Muti wese usinai kusimiwa naBaba vangu vokudenga uchadzuriwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Vasiyei daro! Mbatungamiri marombe, kana rombe rikatungamirira rimwe rombe, vese vanowira mugomba.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Asi Pita adoti kwaari, “Titsumbudzurirei mufananidzo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Jesu adoti, “Naimimiwo kamu hamunati mava kunzvitsitsa? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Munoonaba kuti chese chinopinda mukamwa chinoenda mumimba, chichidzobirika? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Asi chinobirika mukamwa chinobva mumwoyo, chakarecho ndicho chinosvipisa munhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ndava mumwoyo munobirika pfungwa dzidoipa, kuponda, zvivi zvopabonde, upombwe, uhure, kuba, kupupura mabhwodo, kunyeya. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Zvakarezvi ndizvo zvinosvipisa munhu, asi kuja nomanja yasinai kushambiwa kunosvipisaba munhu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukadzi ano Kutenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mariko 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Zvino Jesu adobirika pakarepo achienda kudunhu roTire noSidhoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Ipopo, mukadzi muKhenani anobva kumatunhu yakareyo adouya achidaidzira, “Nai Ishe, Mwanakomana waDhavhiti, ndinzvireiwo tsitsi, mwanasikana wangu ari kutambudziwa zvidoipitsitsa noshave ridomuphotera.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Asi haanai shoko raadomupindura. Zvino vadzidzi vache vadouya ndokumbiritsa vachiti, “Mudzingei, ndava ari kutevera achidaidzira kwatiri.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Adopindura achiti, “Ndidondotumiwa kuhwai dzidotaika dzoimba yaIzirairi basi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Asi iye adouya ndokupfugama pamberi pache achiti, “Ishe, ndibatsirei.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Adopindura achiti, “Hazvinai kufanira kutora chikafu chovana uchichikandira imbwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Iye adoti, “Inde, Ishe, kana noimbwa dzinojawo zvinombwera pasi potafura yaatenzi vadzene.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Ipopo Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Amai imi, kutenda kwenyu nghukuru! itihwai zvamurikuda.” Mwanasikana wache adobva waporerafuti nguwa yakareyo.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Vanhu Vazinji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Kubva pakarepo Jesu adoramba achienda achideva noGungwa roGaririya. Adokwira mugomo, ndokugarikika pasi makaremo. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Ipopo zvaunga zvikuru zvidouya kwaari nomhetamakumbo, vaidzomhira, mapofu, zvimumumu, novamwe vazinji, ndokuvaisa patsoka dzache, achibva wavaporesa, <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />zvokuti chaunga chidoshamisika, pachidoona zvimumumu zvichitaura, zvirema zvichipora, mhetamakumbo dzichitekaira, nomarombe yachiona, vachibva varumbidza Mwari waIzirairi.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoposha Zviuru Zvinai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mariko 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Ipopo Jesu adodaidza vadzidzi vache ndokuti, “Ndinotsitsi nomhomho iyi ndava ivova vatova nomazuva matatu vaneni, vasinai chavaja, handidi kuvaendesa nonzara, vangadzowa chikhomo munzira.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Vadzidzi vadoti kwaari, “Nghupi musango kwatingawane mazingwa yanokwanira chaunga chikurufutichi?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mangani mazingwa yamunayo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Vadoti, “Manomwe, notuhove tudiki tushomashoma.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Adoraira chaunga kuti chigarikike pasi, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />adotora mazingwa manomwe nohove, paadotenda adozvikomora komora ndokuzvipasa vadzidzi vache, vadzidzi ndokupasa chaunga. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Vadoja vese vachiguta, vachibva vaunganidza zvimepfu zvidosara zvikazara tswanda dzinomwe. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Vadoja vacho vanga vari vanhurume zviuru zvinai, vanhukadzi novana vasingaverengewe.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Jesu paadokototsa vanhu, adopinda mukamwadiya ndokuenda kumatunhu yokuMagadhani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Vanopopera Chiratidzo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mariko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Ruka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Zvino vaFarisi novaSadhusi vadouya, kuti vayedze Jesu vadomukumbira kuti avanangidze chiratidzo kubva kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Adovapindura achiti, “Kana yava mauro, munoti, ‘Kunze kuchamira mushe, ndava denga ridotsvuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Kana yari mangwanani, ‘Kuchaita duthu nasi, ndava denga ririkusina sina ridotsvuka.’ Munoziva kurapanura mamiriro yodenga, asi muchitadza kurapanura zviratidzo zvonguwa dzino. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Vanhu vomazuvano vadoipa vasinai kutendeka vanotsvaga chiratidzo, manje hapanai chiratidzo chavachapasiwa kusiya kwochiratidzo chaJona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Ipopo adovasiya achibva waenda.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiriso yovaFarisi noVasadhusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mariko 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Vadzidzi pavadosvika kumhiri, vanga vakoshiwa kutakura kana kazingwako. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Hokoyo, chenjererai mbiriso yovaFarisi novaSadhusi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Zvino vadzidzi vadozvikurukura pakati pavo vachiti, “Hatinai kuuya nomazingwa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Asi Jesu paadozviziva adoti, “Imi vokutenda kudiki, seiko muchikurukura pakati penyu kuti hamunai mazingwa? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Hamunati maakuona nanasi? Munoyeukaba mazingwa mashano pazviuru zvishano, kuti tswanda dzingani dzamudounganidza? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Kana mazingwa manomwe pazviuru zvinai uye kuti tswanda dzingani dzamudounganidza? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Muri kutadza tini kuona kuti ndanyairaba zvomazingwa? Chenjererai mbiriso yovaFarisi novaSadhusi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ipopo vadonzvitsitsa kuti wanga asingavaudze kuti vachenjerere mbiriso yomazingwa, asi yodzidziso yovaFarisi novaSadhusi.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anopupura kuti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mariko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Ruka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Zvino Jesu paadosvika mudunhu rinoitiwa Khesari Firipi, adobvunza vadzidzi vache, “Anga vanhu vanoti Mwanakomana woMunhu mbani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ivo vadoti, “Vamwe vanoti Johwani Muombeki, vamwe vachiti Eriya, vamwewo vachiti Joromiya, kana umwe wovaporofiti.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Asi imimi munoti ndini yani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Pita adopindura achiti, “Ndimi Khirisitu, Mwanakomana waMwari mupenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Zvino Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Udokomborehwa iwepa, Simoni mwanakomana waJona! Ndava nyama nogazi ndizvoba zvakuzururira izvozvi, asi Baba vangu vari kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Zvino ndinokuudza, ndiwe Pita, pamusoro poruware uhu ndichavakha kherekhe yangu, nomasimba yoGehena yachaikundaba. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ndichakupasa makhiyi youmambo hwokudenga, chese chaunosunga panyika chichasungiwa kudenga, nochese chauchasugudura panyika chichasuguduriwa kudenga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ipopo adotsindikira vadzidzi vache kuti vareke kuudza munhu kuti ndiye Khirisitu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anovanyepa Zvokutambudzika noKupfa Kwache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-38">Mariko 8:31-38</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Ruka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kubva panguwa yakareyo Jesu adothanga kunangidza vadzidzi vache kuti anofanira kuenda kuJerusarema kotambudziwa novaphirisita vakuru novadzidzisi vomurairo, pamusoro pozvinhu zvizinji, wobaiwa, nokudzomutsiwa nozuva rochitatu.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Zvino Pita adomutora parutivi ndokuthanga kumudzumidza achiti, “Zvinoitikaba izvo, Ishe! Zvakarezvo mbazvireke kuitika kwamuri.”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Asi Jesu adochununguka ndokuti kuna Pita, “Ibva kwandiri Sathani! Uri chitadziso kwandiri, ndava hausi kudivi raMwari, asi rovanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ipopo Jesu adoudza vadzidzi vache, “Kana munhu achida kunditevera, mbaazvirambe atore muchinjikwa wache anditevere. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Ndava wese anoda kuchidza upenyu hwache anotaikihwa nahwo, nowese anotaikihwa noupenyu hwache nokuda kwangu achahuwana. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Anga chii munhu chaanowana kana akawana nyika yese achipfurutsa upenyu hwache? Kana kuti chii munhu chaachapereka chinotsivana noupenyu hwache? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Ndava Mwanakomana woMunhu achauya nongirozi dzache ari mukubhwinya kwaBaba vache, ipopo acharipa munhu wese zvichienderana nozvaadoita. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, varipo vamwe vadomira pano vasingadzopfa vasati vaona Mwanakomana woMunhu achiuya muumambo hwache.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Kusanduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mariko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Ruka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Mumasure momazuva matanhatu Jesu adotora Pita naJakobho mukoma nomunin'ina’ina naJohwani ndokukwira mugomo rirefu pavo vega. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Ipopo adosanduka pamberi pavo, chiso chache chidoyetima kunge zuva, majasi yache yadoti ngwerevere kunge chiedza. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Zvino padobva paoneka Mozisi naEriya vachinyaira naye. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Pita adoti kuna Jesu, “Ishe, zvidonaka kuti tiri pano, kana muchida, ndichakuvakirai matumba matatu pano, rimwe renyu rimwe raMozisi norimwe raEriya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Paanga achiri kunyaira daipo, padobva pauya guti rinopenya ndokuvafukidza, izvi ridobva muguti rakarero ridoti, “Wakareyu ndiye Mwanakomana wangu wandinoditsitsa, ndinofadziwa naye maninge mutetekerei!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Vadzidzi pavadonzva zvakarezvo, vadokotamira pasi nozviso zvavo, vachicha. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Asi Jesu adouya ndokuvabata, achiti, “Mukai rekai kucha.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Pavadosumudza meso yavo, hapanai wavadoona kunze kwaJesu basi.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Pavanga voburuka mugomo, Jesu adovatsindikira, “Rekai kuudza munhu zvamaona, kusvikira Mwanakomana woMunhu amutsiwa kubva kuvadopfa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Zvino vadzidzi vadomubvunza, “Anga zvino seiko vadzidzisi vomurairo vachiti Eriya ndiye anothanga kuuya?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Iye adopindura achiti, “Eriya anouya, achidzotsera zvinhu zvese, <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />asi ndinokunyepai kuti Eriya adotouya kare, asi havanai kumuziva, vadobva vamuitira zvavaida. NoMwanakomana woMunhu kamu achatambudziwa mumaoko yavo.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ipopo vadzidzi vadonzvitsitsa kuti wanga achivanyairira zvaJohwani Muombeki.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Mukomana ano Shave</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mariko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Ruka 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Pavadosvika pamhomho, murume adouya kwaari ndokupfugama pamberi pache achiti, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Ishe, nzvirai tsitsi mwanakomana wangu, nokuti anopfavi, anotambudzika zvidoipa, kazinji anowira mumoto, pamwe pacho mumvura. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ndidouya naye kuvadzidzi venyu, vachibva vatadzirira kumuporesa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Zvino Jesu adopindura achiti, “Ndichava naimimi kusvikira rini, naimi vanhu vanasi vadopombonyoka, vasinai kutenda? Ndichakuitirai mwoyo murefu kusvika rini? Uyai naye kuno kwandiri.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Ipopo Jesu adodzuma shave, richibva rabirika mukomana achibva waporerafuti.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Pasure vadzidzi vadouya kuna Jesu kabisira vachiti, “Ko isisu tatadzirira tini kuridzinga?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Adoti kwavari, “Indava yokutenda kwenyu kudiki. Ndava chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, kana muno kutenda kudiki kunge mbeu yomasitadhi, muchati kugomo iri, ‘Ibva pano uende uko,’ richaenda, hapanai chingatadzike nemi.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Asi rudzi iri rinobirikaba kunze kwokunamata nokutsanya.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Kamu zvoIpfa Yache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mariko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Ruka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Pavadosangana kuGaririya, Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mwanakomana woMunhu achaperekewa mumaoko yovanhu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />ivo vachamubaya, asi pazuva rochitatu achamutsiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Ivo vadoshushikana nazvo chaizvo.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuripa Mutero woImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Pavadosvika kuKaperenaume, vateresi vomutero woimba yaMwari vadoenda kuna Pita vachiti, “Ko mudzidzisi wenyu anoteraba mutero nai?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Iye adoti, “Anotera inde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Kudzoti Pita wasvika kumba, Jesu ndiye adothanga kunyaira kwaari achiti, “Unofungei, Simoni? Madzimambo vonyika vanotora mitero kunani? Kubva kuvanakomana vavo chere kana kuvamwewo?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Iye paadoti, “Kubva kuvamwewo,” Jesu adoti kwaari,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">“Saka vanakomana vadosunungukaka. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Zvisinei, kuti tireke kuvagumbura, enda kugungwa wokhanda chirauro, utore hove inothanga kubirika, ukavhura mukamwa mayene uchawana kobiri rinokosha, ritore uvapase yangu noyako.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mbani Mukuru?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mariko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Ruka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Panguwa yakareyo vadzidzi vadouya kuna Jesu vachiti, “Mbani mukuru muumambo hwokudenga?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Zvino adodaidza mwana kwaari ndokumuisa pakati pavo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />achibva wati, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri kana, musingasanduke muchiita kunge vana, munopindaba muumambo hwokudenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Wese anozvidikipisa kunge mwana wakareyu, ndiye mukuru maninge muumambo hwokudenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />“Wese anotambira muzita rangu mwana mudiki adodaro anotambira inini.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muedzo kuti Utadze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mariko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Ruka 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Uyo wese anokonzera umwe wovadiki vakareva vanotenda kwandiri kuti atadze, hasa kutoti guyo rikuru risungirihwe muhuro mache achudumutsiwe kumagwinakwina kwogungwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />“Nhamu kunyika nondava yomiedzo inokonzera vanhu kutadza! Muedzo inofanira kuuya zvayene, asi nhamu kumunhu anoiwuyisa!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Futi kana ruoko rako kana kuti tsoka ichikonzera kuti utadze, igwate uitaye! Hasa kupinda muupenyu udoremara kana kuti udogwatika panokuti ukhandiwe mumoto usingapere unomaoko mairi notsoka dziiri. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Kana ziso rako richikukonzera kutadza, ritokonore uritaye, hasa kwauri kupinda muupenyu uno ziso ribodzi panokuti ukhandiwe mugehena romoto unomaziso mairi.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woHwai Idotaika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Ruka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Onai kuti munozvidzaba umwe wovadiki vakareva. Ndava ndinokunyepai kuti ngirozi dzavo kudenga dzinenge dziripo panaBaba vangu vari kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Ndava Mwanakomana woMunhu adouya koponesa adotaika.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Munofungei? Kana munhu ano mahwai zana, rimwe rikataika, anosiyaba nai makumi mapfemba nomapfemba mumakomo achienda kotsvaga ribodzi ridotaika? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Chokwadi, ndinokunyepai kuti kana wariwana, anorifarira kukunda makumi mapfemba nomapfemba yasinai kutaika. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Nonzira ibodzibodziyo Baba venyu vari kudenga vanodaba kuti umwe wovadiki vakareva aparadzike.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana Munhu Watadza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Kana hama yako yakutadzira, enda komuudza uyanga hwache, muri pauviri hwenyu. Kana akakutetekera, wazviwanira hama yako. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Asi kana waramba kukutetekera, tora umwe kana vairi muende mese, kuti nyaya yese isimbisiwe noupfakazi hwovairi kana vatatu. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Kana akaramba kuvatetekera, zviudze kherekhe, kana akaramba kutetekera nokherekheyo, mutorei kunge wokunze kana muteresi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kurambidza Nokubvumidza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, chese chamunosunga panyika chichasungiwa kudenga, nochamunosugudura panyika chichasuguduhwa kudenga.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Pakare ndinoti kwamuri, kana vairi venyu mukabvumirana panyika pamusoro pochinhu chipi zvachene chamunokumbira, muchachiitihwa naBaba vangu vari kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ndava panoungana vairi kana vatatu muzita rangu, pakarepo ndiripo pakati pavo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMuranda Asingaregerere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Zvino Pita adouya kwaari achiti, “Ishe, hama yangu inganditadzire kangani ndichimbondoiregerera? Kanomwe chere?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Handiti kwauri kanomwe, asi makumi manomwe yadopetewa kanomwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Saka umambo hwokudenga hungaenzanisiwe namambo waida kunhadzirisa zvikwerete novaranda vache. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Paadothanga kuverenga, umwe wanga ano chikwerete chozviuru gumi zvomasaga yondarama, adouyisiwa kwaari. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Nondava yokutadzirira kuripa, ishe wache adoraira kuti iye atengesewe, pabodzi nomukadzi wache novana nozvese zvaanga anazvo, kuti chikwerete chiripiwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Muranda adogodama nomabvi pamberi pache ndokuti, ‘Ishe ndiitirei mwoyo murefu, ndichakuripai zvese.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Tenzi womuranda adoita tsitsi, ndokumuregerera kuti aende zvache.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Asi muranda mubodzi bodziyo, paadobirika pakarepo, adouya kunoumwe muranda biyache wanga ano chikwerete kwaari chomakobiri zana yanonzi dhinari adomubata pahuro achiti, ‘Ripa chikwerete chako.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Muranda biyache adogodama nomabvi achimukumbira achiti, ‘Ndiitire mwoyo murefu, ndichakuripa.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Asi iye adoramba ndokuenda komuisa mutorongo kusvikira waripa chikwerete. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Zvino varanda biyache pavadoona zvanga zvaitiwa, vadoshungurudziwa nazvo chaizvo, ndokuenda konyepa tenzi wavo zvese zvanga zvaitika. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Ipopo tenzi adodaidza muranda ndokuti kwaari, ‘Iwe muranda adoipa! Ndidokuregerera chikwerete chiye chese ndava wanga wandikumbira, <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />ko wanga usingafaniriwo kuitira tsitsi muranda biyako kunge zvandidokuitira iwepa?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Noukari tenzi wache adomuendesa kuno vokutorongo, kuti atambudziwe kusvikira aripa chikwerete chache chese.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Zvakarezvo ndizvo zvichaitiwa naBaba vangu vokudenga kwamuri umwe noumwe, kana musingaregerere hama yenyu zvichibva pamwoyo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Dzidziso pamusoro poKusarambana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mariko 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Zvino Jesu paadopedza kunyaira kwakareku, adobirika kubva muGaririya achipinda mumatunhu yoJudhiya kumhiri kwohwizi Jorodhani, <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />mhomho dzikuru dzovanhu dzidomutevera iye ndokuvaporesa kwakareko.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Zvino vamwe vaFarisi vadouya kwaari vachimuedza ndokumubvunza vachiti, “Zviri pamutemo chere kuti munhu arambe mukadzi wache nochikonzero chipi zvachene?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Adopindura, “Hamunai nai kuverenga kuti iye nyakuvasika kubva pakuthanga adovaita munhurume nomunhukadzi, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />achibva wati, ‘Nochikonzero chakarecho murume achasiya baba vache naamai vache achibatanidziwa nomukadzi wache, vairivo vobva vava muviri mubodzi?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Nokudaro vachiriba vairi asi vava muviri mubodzi. Icho chabatanidziwa naMwari mbapareke ndipo kuva nomunhu anochikwachura.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Vadoti kwaari, “Manje sei Mozisi adoraira kuti murume apereke gupuro kumukadzi womuendesa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Noukukutu hwomwoyo yenyu Mozisi adokubvumirai kuramba vakadzi venyu, asi kubva pamavambo zvanga zvisinai kudaro. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Futi ndinoti kwamuri, wese anoramba mukadzi wache nondava yochimwe chikonzero chisiri uhure, akaroora umwe watoita upombwe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Vadzidzi vache vadoti kwaari, “Kana zvidodaro pamurume nomukadzi wache hasa kundoreka kuroora.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Asi iye adoti kwavari, “Havasi vese vanhu vanotambira kutaura kwakareku, kusiya kwaivo chete vadopasiwa kuti vazvikwanise. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Ndava pano ngomwa dzidondozvahwa dzidodaro, pova nongomwa dzokusunuriwa novanhu, poita ngomwa dzidozviita ngomwa dzega nondava youmambo hwokudenga. Anokwanisa kuzvitambira, mbaazvitambire.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoropafadza Vana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mariko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:15-17">Ruka 19:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Zvino vana vadiki vadoisiwa kwaari kuti avaturike manja yache achivanamatira. Vadzidzi vadodzumidza vanhu, <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />asi Jesu adoti, “Rekai vana vauye kwandiri, rekai kuvarambidza, ndava vadodaiva umambo hwokudenga ngwavo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Wabva kuvaturika manja yache adobva waenda.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jaha Mupfumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mariko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Ruka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ipopo pano adouya kwaari achiti, “Mudzidzisi, “Chii chidonaka chandinofanira kuita, kuti ndive noupenyu husingapere?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Zvino Jesu adoti kwaari, “Unondibvunzireiko pamusoro pochidonaka? Panomubodzi basi adonaka. Kana uchida kupinda muupenyu, chengeta mirairo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Adoti kwaari, “Ipi yacho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Jesu adoti, “Reka kubaya, reka kuita upombwe, reka kuba, reka kuita upfakazi hwomabhwodo, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />kudza baba vako namaako, futi unofanira kuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Jaha ridoti kwaari, “Zvese zvakarezvi ndidozvichengeta, chii chandichiri kusaya?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Kana uchida kukwana, enda kotengesa zvaunazvo upase varombo ipopo uchava nopfuma kudenga, wouya kudzonditevera.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Jaha paridonzva izvozvo ridoenda ridododoma kaso, ndava ranga rino zvinhu zvidowanditsa.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Zvino Jesu adoti kuvadzidzi vache, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, zvichaoma kuti mupfumi apinde muumambo hwokudenga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Futi ndinokunyepai kuti, zvidopusira ngamera kupinda nopakaboo konariti panokuti mupfumi apinde muumambo hwaMwari.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Vadzidzi pavadonzva zvakarezvo vadoshamisika chaizvo ndokuti, “Zvino mbani angaponesewe?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Asi Jesu adovanangara ndokuti kwavari, “Novanhu izvi hazvikwanisike, asi naMwari zvinhu zvese zvinokwanisika.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Ipopo Pita adoti, “Onai, isisu tidosiya zvese tichikuteverai. Chii zvino chatichawana?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Ndinokunyepai chokwadi, pakuvandudziwa kwozvinhu zvese, Mwanakomana woMunhu paanenge wagarikika pamupando wache woushe unoyetima, achitonga marudzi gumi nomairi yovaIzirairi. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Pakare wese adosiya dzimba kana vakoma kana hanzvadzi kana baba kana amai kana vana kana minda nondava yangu achatambira zvidopetewa kazana uye nhaka youpenyu husingapere. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Asi vazinji vari vokuthanga vachava vokupedzisira, novazinji vokupedzisira vova vokuthanga.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Vashandi muMunda woMizambiringa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Umambo hwokudenga hudoita kunge muridzi womunda adobirika mangwanani kotsvaga vashandi vomumunda wache womizambiringa <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Musure mokubvumirana novashandi kuvaripa dhinari pazuva, adobva wavatuma kumunda wache womizambiringa. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Adobirika paawa yochipfemba mangwanani ndokuona vamwe vadondoti puru, pamusika, <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />adoti kwavari, ‘Naimipa endaiwo kumunda womizambiringa, chese chidokodzera ndinokupasai.’ Vachibva vadoenda. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Adobirika pakare paawa inenge yogumi nodziiri noyochitatu masikati achiita zvibodzi bodzizvo. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Dzava nguwa dzogumi noibodzi adobirika ndokuwana vamwe vadondoti puru, adovabvunza achiti, ‘Mudomirirei pano zuva rese pasinai chamurikuita?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Vadomupindura vachiti, ‘Ndava hapanai watidaidza kundomba.’ Adoti kwavari, ‘Endaiwo koita basa kumunda womizambiringa.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Kudzoti yava mauro, muridzi womunda womizambiringa adoti kumutariri wache, ‘Daidza vashandi uvahorese mibairo yavo, uchithanga nowokupedzisira, uchiguma nowathanga.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Padouya vaye vadopasiwa basa paawa yogumi noibodzi, vadotambirisiwa dhinari pamunhu. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Manje vokuthanga pavadodzouya vadofunga kuti vachatambirisiwa idowanda, asi vese vadondotambirisiwa dhinari pamunhu. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Pavadoritambira vadonyunyutira muridzi womusha, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />vachiti, ‘Ava vokupedzisira vandoshanda awa ibodzi basi, imipa mavaenzanisa naisisu tasvera tichibinduka zuva richitsvonda kupisa.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Asi adopindura umwe wavo, ‘Shamwari, hapanai chandakukanganisira, haunai kubvumirana nainini dhinari ribodzi here? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Tora chako, uende, ndasarudza kupasa wokupedzisira kunge zvandakupasa iwepa. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Anga ndinobvumihwaba nai kuita zvandinoda nozvinhu zvangu? Kana kuti watsvisiwa mwoyo nokupereka kwangu?’<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Saka vokupedzisira vachava vokuthanga, novokuthanga vova vokupedzisira.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira zvoIpfa Yache koChitatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mariko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Ruka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Jesu paanga achienda kuJerusarema, ari munzira adotora parutivi vadzidzi vanogumi novairi, ndokuti kwavari, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Onai, tiri kuenda kuJerusarema, uye Mwanakomana woMunhu achaperekewa kuvaprista vakuru novadzidzisi vomurairo, ivo vachamutongera ipfa, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />vomupereka kuno voDzimwe Ndudzi kuti vamunyadze nokumurova vodzomurovera pamuchinjikwa, iye wodzomutsiwa nozuva rochitatu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikumbiro Chaamai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mariko 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ipopo amai vovanakomana vaZebhedhi vadouya kuna Jesu, novanakomana vavo, vachibva vapfugama pamberi pache ndokumuruvira chimwe chinhu.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Iye adoti kwaari, “Anga chii chaunoda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Adoti kwaari, “Tenderai kuti vanakomana vangu vairi ava, vagare umwe kuruoko renyu roruji umwe kurubose kwenyu, muumambo hwenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Asi Jesu adopindura achiti, “Munozivaba zvamunoruvira. Munokona nai iyemi kumwa mukombe wandichamwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Vadoti kwaari, “Tinokona.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Adoti kwavari, “Muchamwa zvenyu mukombe wangu, asi zvokugarikika kuruoko rangu roruji norokumabose nzvanguba kuti ndizvipase, asi nzvoavo vadozvigadzirihwa naBaba vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Manje vadzidzi gumi pavadozvinzva, vadomwamwira mukoma nomunin'ina’ina. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Asi Jesu adovadaidza kuti vauye kwaari ndokuti, “Munoziva kuti vatongi voDzimwe Ndudzi vano simba pamusoro pavo, vakuru vavo vanoita mukurira pavari. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Mbazvirege kudaro pakati penyu, asi wese anoda kuva mukuru pakati penyu mbaave mushandi wenyu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />nowese anoda kuva wokuthanga pakati penyu mbaave muranda wenyu, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />ndomwenze iye Mwanakomana woMunhu asinai kuuya kudzoshumihwa, asi kudzoshumira, nokupereka upenyu hwache kuti huve rudzikinuro rovazinji.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Marombe Mairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:26-52">Mariko 10:26-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Ruka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Jesu novadzidzi vache pavanga vaakubirika muJeriko, mhomho ikuru idomutevera. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Padoita, marombe mairi vanga vadogarikika panyasi nonzira, pavadonzva kuti ndiJesu ari kupinda, vadodaidzira vachiti, “Ishe, Mwanakomana waDhavhiti, tinzvirei tsitsi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Mhomho idovadzumidza, ichivaudza kuti vanyarare, asi ivo vadokungudzitsirafuti, “Ishe, Mwanakomana waDhavhiti, tinzvirei tsitsi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Jesu adomira ndokuvadaidza achiti, “Chii chamunoda kuti ndikuitirei?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vadoti kwaari, “Ishe, kuti meso yedu yaone.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Jesu notsitsi adobata meso yavo, kabodzi nokabodzi vadopenyerafuti vachibva vamutevera.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Kupinda muJerusarema Achipemberehwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mariko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Ruka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Johwani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Kudzoti vaapanyasi noJerusarema vatosvika Bhetifegi paGomo roMiorivhi, Jesu adotuma vadzidzi vairi, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />achiti kwavari, “Endai mumusha uri pamberi penyu, muchabva maona buru ridosungirihwa, rino kamhuru karene, yasugudurei muuye nayo kwandiri. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Kana pano munhu anotaura chinhu kwamuri, taurai kuti, ‘Ishe anoyada,’ ipopo achabva wayatumira.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Izvi zvidoitika kuzazisa zvidonyaihwa nomuporofiti achiti,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Nyairirai mwanasikana woZioni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Nangara, mambo wako ari kuuya kwauri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">nokuzvininipisa, adogadha kaburu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">iko kamwana koburu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Vadzidzi vadoenda ndokuita zvavadoraihwa naJesu, <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />vadouya nombongoro nokamwana kayene, vachibva vaisa hembe dzavo pamusoro pakene, ndokubva Jesu wakagadha. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Vazinji mukati mogurusvusvu vadowaridza hembe dzavo munzira, vamwe ndivo vaitema mathai yomiti vachiyawaridza munziramo. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Vazinji vaitekaira pamberi novaitevera mumasure mache vadodaidzira vachiti, “Hozana kuMwanakomana waDhavhiti! Adokomborehwa iye anouya muzita raIshe! Hozana kumusorosoro!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Paadopinda muguta roJerusarema, vanhu vese vadovhunduka vachibva vati, “Mbaniko iyeyu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Mhomho idoti, “Uyu muporofiti Jesu anobva muguta roNazareta kuGaririya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoenda kuImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mariko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Ruka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Johwani 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Jesu adopinda muimba yaMwari ndokudzinga vese vaitengesa novaitenga muimba yaMwari, adophidigura mathafura yovaitsinhana mari nomipando yovaitengesa hangaiva. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Adoti kwavari, “Kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Imba yangu ichadaidziwa kuti imba yokunamatira,’ asi imipa maiita bako romakororo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ipopo marombe nomhetamakumbo vadouya kwaari muimba yaMwari achibva wavaporesa. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Asi vaphirisita vakuru novadzidzisi vomurairo pavadoona zvinhu zvinoshamisa zvaaiita, novana vachidaidzira mukati moimba yaMwari, “Hozana kuMwanakomana waDhavhiti!” vadosemburiwa, <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />vadobva vati kwaari, “Muri kunzva chere zviri kunyairiwa novana vakareva?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Jesu adoti kwavari, “Inde, hamunai kuverenga nai, ‘Kubva mumiromo yovana novanomwa mudobirika rumbidzo idokwana?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Adovasiya, achibva wabirika muguta kuenda kuBhetani ndokuenzera kwakareko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoshurikidza Mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mariko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Mangwanani ngwanani, achidzokera kuguta, adonzva nzara. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Adoona mukuyu parutivi ponzira ndokuenda kwauri, paadosaya chaadowana mauri kunze kwomazani basi. Adobva wati kwauri, “Mbakurekerefuti kudzowanika muchero pauri!” Mukuyu udobva wasvavirafuti pakarepo.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Vadzidzi pavadozviona vadoshamisika vachiti, “Ko sei mukuyu wabva waunirafuti?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, kana muno kutenda pasinai kana kutsakidza, maipereraba kundoita zvaitiwa pamukuyu, asi kana mukati kugomo iri, ‘Dzupuka uwire mugungwa,’ zvinoitika. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Futi chese chamunokumbira nomunamato, muno chitambira, kana muno kutenda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo pamusoro poSimba raJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mariko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Ruka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Jesu paadopinda muimba yaMwari, vaphirisita vakuru novatungamiri vovanhu vadouya kwaari ari pakudzidzisa, ndokuti, “Anga isimba hwai raunoita naro zvinhu zvakarezvi noadokupasa simbaro mbani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Jesu adovapindura, “Nainipano ndichakubvunzaiwo mubvunzo, kana mukandiudza mhinduro naininiwo ndichakuudzai simba randinoita naro zvinhu zvakarezvi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Ruombeko raJohwani, rudobva poi? Kudenga chere kana kuvanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Ipopo vadopikisana, “Tikati, ‘Ridobva kudenga,’ achati kwatiri, ‘zvino mudorekerei kumutenda?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Asi kana tikati, ‘Ridobva kuvanhu,’ tinocha mhomho, ndava vese vanoti Johwani wanga ari muporofiti.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Saka vadopindura Jesu vachiti, “Hatizive.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Iye ndokuti kwavari, “Nainipano ndinokunyepaiba simba randinoita naro zvinhu zvakarezvi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woVanakomana Vairi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Munofungei? Murume anga ano vanakomana vairi, adoenda kuno wokuthanga ndokuti, ‘Mwanakomana, enda nasi koshanda mumunda womizambiringa.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Iye adopindura achiti, ‘Handidi, asi pasure adodzopinduka ndokuenda. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Adoenda kuno wochipiri achitaura zvibodzi bodzizvo, ipopo mwanakomana adopindura achiti, ‘Ndiri kuenda baba,’ asi haanai kuenda. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ngupi pavairi adoita kuda kwababa vache?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Vadoti, “Wokuthanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, vateresi nomahure vanokuthangirai kupinda muumambo hwokudenga. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ndava Johwani adouya kwamuri nonzira yokururama, asi hamunai kumutenda, asi vateresi nomahure vadomutenda, kana pamudozviona hamunai kudzopinduka muchimutenda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woVashandi muMunda woMizambiringa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mariko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Ruka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />“Inzvai umwe mufananidzo. Panga pano mwenekachiro womunda adorima munda wache womizambiringa, ndokuusosera, ndokuchera gomba rokusvinira muto mukati mawene, nokuvakha chirindo, ndokuusiira vashandi achienda kuno imwe nyika. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Nguwa yokukohwa payanga yasvika, adotuma varanda vache kuvashandi, kuti vatore michero yache, <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />vashandi vadobata varanda vache ndokurova umwe, umwe vachibaya, umwe vachimutema nomabhwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Adotuma kamu vamwe varanda, kukunda vokuthanga, ivo ndokuvaitira zvibodzi bodzizvo. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Pasure adodzotuma mwanakomana wache kwavari, achiti, ‘Vacharemekedza mwanakomana wangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Asi vashandi pavadoona mwanakomana, vadotaurirana vachiti, ‘Uyu ndiye muji wonhaka, mbatimubayei titore nhaka yache.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Vadomubata ndokumukhandidzira kunze kwomunda womizambiringa, vachimubaya.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Ko zvino kana muridzi womunda womizambiringa akauya, chii chaachaita kuvashandi vakarevo?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Vaphirisita novatungamiri vovanhu vadoti kwaari, “Achabaya vaipivo zvisinai tsitsi, woisa vamwe vashandi pamunda womizambiringa vachamupasa michero nonguwa idofanira.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Hamunai kuverenga mumagwaro nai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Mhanda idorambiwa novavakhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">ndiyo idodzova nyakatenga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Uku kwanga kuri kuita kwaIshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">futi kunoshamisa mumeso yedu!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Saka ndinokunyepai, umambo hwokudenga huchabisiwa kwamuri huchipasiwa rimwe rudzi runouyisa michero yacho.<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Futi wese anowira padombo rakareri achabeduka beduka, asi warinowira iro rinomukuya kuita upfu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Vaphirisita vakuru novaFarisi pavadonzva mifananidzo yache, vadozingwa kuti wainyaira ivo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Asi pavadoedza kumusunga, vadocha vanhu, ndava vaiti muporofiti.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMabiko yoMuchato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Ruka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Zvino Jesu adonyaira kamu kwavari nomifananidzo achiti, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Umambo hwokudenga hungaenzanisiwe namambo adoitira mwanakomana wache mabiko yomuchato, <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />ndokutuma varanda vache kodaidza vaye vaadokokera kumabiko yomuchato, asi havanai kuuya. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Adotuma kamu vamwe varanda, achiti, ‘Udzai vadokokewa vaye, Onai, ndanhadzira kusvusvura kwangu, madhonza yangu nozvimhuru zvangu zvidokora zvabaiwa, futi zvinhu zvese zvanhadzihwa, uyai kumabiko yomuchato.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Asi vadozviita zvisina basa, ndokuenda zvavo, umwe kupurazi rache, umwe kumaronda yache, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />vamwe ndivo vadobata varanda vache, vachivaitira zvidoipa, nokuvabaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mambo adokaripa, achibva watuma mauto koparadza mhondi dzakaredzo nokupisa guta radzene. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ipopo adoti kuvaranda vache, ‘Muchato wagadzihwa, asi vanga vadokokewa vaye vanga vasinai kufanira. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Endai kumhararano dzonzira, mukokere kumabiko yomuchato wese wamawana.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Varanda vadoenda mumigwagwa vachiunganidza vese vavadowana, vadoipa novadonaka, zvokuti imba yokuchatira idozara novarendo.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Asi mambo paadopinda koona varendo, adoona munhu wanga asinai hembe yomuchato, <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />adoti kwaari, ‘Shamwari, wapinda tini muno usinai hembe yomuchato?’ Adondoti zii. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Ipopo mambo adoti kuvarindi, ‘Musungei maoko nomakumbo, mumukandidzire kurima rokunze, kwakareko vanhu vacharira vachigedageda meno yavo.’<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Ndava vadodaidziwa mbazinji asi vadosaruhwa mbashoma.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo woKuripa Mitero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mariko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Ruka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Ipopo vaFarisi vadobirika vachipangana mabatiro yavangamuite pakunyaira kwache. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Vadobva vatuma vadzidzi vavo kwaari, pabodzi novatsigiri vaHerudhe vachiti, “Mudzidzisi, tinoziva kuti muri wochokwadi, futi munodzidzisa nzira yaMwari pachokwadi, musinai basa nozvinofungiwa nomunhu, ndava hamunei kuti munhu mbani. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Saka tinyepei zvamunofunga. Zviri pamutemo chere kuripa mitero kuna Khesari kana kureka?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Asi Jesu nokuziva mufungo wavo udoipa, adoti kwavari, “Imi vanyengeri, indava yei muchinditeya? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Ndinangidzei kobiri romutero.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Ivo vadouya naro kwaari. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Jesu ndokuti kwavari, “Anga mufananidzo nozita iri nzvaani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Vadoti, “NzvaKesari.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Ipopo adoti kwavari, “Perekai ndipo kuna Khesari zvinhu zvaKesari, nokuna Mwari zvinhu zvaMwari.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Pavadozvinzva, vadoshamisika, vadomusiya vachibva vaenda.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo woKumuka kuVadopfa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mariko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Ruka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Zuva rakarero, vaSadhusi ivo vanoti hakunai kumuka kwovadopfa, vadouya kwaari, vachibva vamubvunza mubvunzo, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />vachiti, “Mudzidzisi, Mozisi adoti, ‘Kana munhu wapfa, asinai vana, munin'ina wache mbaaroore mujiche wacho, kuti amutsire mukoma wache vana.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Manje pakati pedu paiva novakoma novanin'ina vanomwe, wokuthanga adoroora, ndokupfa asinai vana, mukadzi wache adobva wagahwa nhaka nomunin'ina. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ndozvibodzi bodzizvo kuno munin'ina’ina wochipiri nowochitatu kusvikira kuno munin'ina’ina wochinomwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Vese vapera daipo, mukadzi adodzopedzisira wapfawo. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Zvino pakumuka kwovadopfa, achava mukadzi woupi pavanomwevo, zvaadova mukadzi wavo vese?”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Asi Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Muri kukanganisa, ndava munozivaba magwaro kana simba raMwari. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ndava pakumuka vanhu havaroore kana kuroorewa, asi vadoita kunge ngirozi dziri kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Futi kana kuri kumuka kwovadopfa, mudoverengaba nai zvidorehwa kwamuri naMwari, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Ndini Mwari waAbhurahamu, naMwari waIsaki, naMwari waJakobho.’ Haasi Mwari wovadopfa asi wovapenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Zvino mhomho paidozvinzva, idoshamisika nokudzidzisa kwache.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutemo Mukuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mariko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Ruka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Asi vaFarisi pavadonzva kuti wapwisa vaSadhusi, vadoungana, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Umwe wavo, gweta nyanzvi yomutemo, adomubvunza mubvunzo achimuedza. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mudzidzisi, mumutemo ngupi murairo mukuru?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Futi adoti kwaari, “‘Unofanira kuda Ishe Mwari wako nomwoyo wako wese, nomweya wako wese, nokufunga kwako kwese.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Wakareyu ndiwo murairo mukuru nowokuthanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Wochipiri udofanana naiwoyu nguyu, ‘Unofanira kuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Pamirairo yakarei miviri ndipo padotsamira mutemo wese nodzidziso dzovaporofiti.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo nozvaMesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mariko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Ruka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Zvino vaFarisi pavanga vaungana pabodzi, Jesu adovabvunza mubvunzo, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />achiti, “Munofungei nozva Khirisitu? Mwanakomana waani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Vadoti kwaari, “Mwanakomana waDhavhiti.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Adoti kwavari, “Sei zvino Dhavhiti, paadotungamihwa naMweya, achimudaidza kuti Ishe, paanoti,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Ishe adoti kuna Ishe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Garikika kuruoko rangu roruji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">kusvikira ndaisa vavengi vako pasi potsoka dzako.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Kana Dhavhiti achimudaidza daro kuti Ishe, anodzova tini mwanakomana wache?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Hapanai adokona kumupindura kana shoko ribodzi, hapanai kamu kubva pazuva rakarero adodzotsunga kumubvunza umwe mubvunzo.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo pamusoro poVadzidzisi voMitemo novaFarisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38">Mariko 12:38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Ruka 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Zvino Jesu adoti kumhomho nokuvadzidzi vache, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi mbadudziri vomutemo waMozisi, <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />itai uye chengetai zvese zvavanokuudzai, asi aikona kuita zvavanoita, ndava zvavanoparidza, hazvisi zvavanoita. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Vanosunga mitoro inorema, isingatakurike, vachiiisa pamapfudzi yovanhu, asi ivo pachavo vanodaba kana nokubatsirako. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Zvavanoita zvese nzvokuda kuonewa novanhu, ndava vanokudza tuborosa tavo tavanosungirira pahuma vachitorephesa mapfundo yomukombero womajasi yavo, <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />nokufarira nzvimbo dzochiremerera pamabiko nomipando idonakitsitsa mumasinagoge, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />nokumoresewa zvinorukudzo pamisika, nokudaidziwa kuti mudzidzisi novanhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Asi imipa rekai kudaidziwa kuti mudzidzisi, ndava muno Mudzidzisi mubodzi, mese muri vakoma novanin'ina’ina. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Musadaidze munhu ari panyika kuti baba venyu, ndava muna Baba mubodzi, ari kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Rekai kudaidziwa kuti mutungamiri, ndava muno Mutungamiri mubodzi, iye Khirisitu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Mukuru maninge pakati penyu mbaave muranda wenyu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Wese anozvikwidziridza achaninipisiwa, nowese anozvininipisa achakwiridzihwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoshora Unyengeri Hwavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mariko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Ruka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Mayanga kwamuri, vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi, vanyengeri! ndava munozaririra vanhu kunze umambo hwokudenga, ndava imipa pachenyu munopindaba, novanoda kupinda vacho hamuvabvumire. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Mayanga kwamuri, vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi, vanyengeri! Ndava munotora midziyo yovajiche, muchinyepera kuita minamato mirefu. Saka muchapasiwa mhosva ikuru.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Mayanga kwamuri, vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi, vanyengeri! ndava munopoterera gungwa nonyika kuti muwane mubodzi wokupindutsira kuchiJudha, kana wapinduka, munomuita mwana woGehena zvidopetewa kairi kupinda zvamuri imipa.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Mayanga kwamuri, vatungamiri marombe, vanoti, ‘Kana munhu akapika noimba yaMwari, hazvinai basa, asi kana munhu akapika nondarama yoimba yaMwari wasungiwa nomhiko yache.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Imi marombe madzemwa! Anga chii chikuru, ndarama kana imba yaMwari inoita kuti ndarama iyere? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Futi munoti, ‘Kana munhu akapika noatari, hazvinai basa, asi kana munhu akapika nochipo chiri paatari, wasungiwa nomhiko yache.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Imi marombe! Anga chii chikuru, chipo kana atari inoita kuti chipo chiyere? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Saka anopika noatari, anopika nayo pabodzi nozviri pairi zvese, <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />nouyo anopika noimba yaMwari, anopika nayo pabodzi naMwari anogara makaremo, <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />nouyo anopika nodenga, anopika nomupando waMwari pabodzi naMwari anougarirayo.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Mayanga kwamuri, vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi, vanyengeri! Ndava munobisa chogumi chomindi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mazani yanonushira </char><char style="fp" closed="false" /><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note> nodhiri, nokhumini, asi mudosiya zvinhu zvinobasa pamutemo zvinoti, kuenzanisa, notsitsi nokutendeka, izvi maifanira kuzviita, asi musingasiye zvimwe zvacho. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Imi vatungamiri marombe, munoungura muchibiritsa kanyerere asi muchinyongomedza ngamera!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Mayanga kwamuri, vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi, vanyengeri! ndava munosuka kunze kwokomichi nondiro, asi mukati mudozara zvidopambiwa nonhafu. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Iwe muFarisi rombe! thanga kusuka mukati mokhomichi nondiro, kuti nokunze kuchenewo.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Mayanga kwamuri, vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi, vanyengeri! Ndava munenge manda yadopendewa, yanooneka kunaka kunze, asi mukati yadozara mapfupa yovanhu vadopfa notsambwa dzese. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Naimipawo munooneka novanhu kururama kunze, asi mukati mudozara unyengeri nounhura.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporofita Murango Wavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Ruka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Mayanga kwamuri, vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi, vanyengeri! ndava munovakha makuwa yovaporofiti nokushongedza zviumbwa zvovadorurama, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />muchiti, ‘Dai tidorarama mumazuva yomadzibaba yedu, dai tisinai kubatana navo kuteura gazi rovaporofiti.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Saka muri kuzvipupurira mega kuti muri vana voavo vadoponda vaporofiti. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Endererai mberi ndipo nokuzaza chiyero chidosiiwa nomadzibaba yenyu. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Imi nyoka, vana vonyoka, munopunyuka tini mutongo wokuti muendesewe kunzvimbo yokutambudzika nokusingapere? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ndichakutumirai ndipo vaporofiti novachenjeri novadzidzisi vomutemo, vamwe vacho muchabaya nokurovera pamuchinjikwa, vamwe ndivo vamucharova mumasinagoge yenyu nokuvatambudza kubva muguta rimwe muchienda kunorimwe guta. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Kuti pamusoro penyu pauyisiwe gazi rese rovadorurama ridoteuhwa panyika, kubva pagazi raEbhero asinai mhosva kusvika pagazi raZakariya mwanakomana waBherekiya, wamudobayira pakati poimba yaMwari noatari. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Chokwadi ndinokunyepai, izvozvi zvese zvichauya pamusoro povanhu ivova vonguwa iyoino!<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rudo raJesu kuJerusarema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34">Ruka 13:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Jerusarema, Jerusarema, unobaya vaporofiti nokutema nomabhwe vaye vanotumiwa kwauri! Kazinji sei pandaida kuunganidza vana vako pabodzi kunge tsekese inovhumbamira tutiyo tayene mumaphaphiro mayene, manje maramba! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Nangarai imba yaMwari yasiiwa iri don’o. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ndava ndinokuudzai, muchandionaba kamu, kusvikira muchidzoti, ‘Adokomborehwa iye anouya muzita raIshe.’”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Zvokuparadziwa kwoJerusarema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mariko 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Ruka 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Jesu adobirika muimba yaMwari, waakutoenda, ndopadouya vadzidzi vache vachimunangidza mavakhihwo yoimba yaMwari. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Asi adovapindura, “Muri kuona zvese izvi, handiti? Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, hapanai ribhwe richaramba riri pamusoro porimwe, risingazokoromorehwa pasi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhamu noKutambudziwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mariko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Ruka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Paadogara paGomo romiOrivhi, vadzidzi vache vadouya kwaari kabisira, vachiti, “Tinyepei, izvozvi nzvarini, nochiratidzo chokuuya kwenyu nochokuguma kwonyika?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Chenjerai kuti pareke kuva nomunhu anokutsambutsai. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Ndava vazinji vachauya muzita rangu vachiti, ‘Ndini Khirisitu,’ vachitsambutsa vazinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Muchanzva zvohondo nomarehwarehwa yohondo, asi rekai kuvhunduka, ndava zvakarezvi zvinofanira kuitika, asi kuguma kunenge kusati kwasvika. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Ndava rudzi ruchamukira rudzi, noumambo huchamukira umambo, kuchava nonzara nokugwetedzeka kwonyika munzvimbo dzizinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Zvese zvakarezvi zvichava mavambo yokudzimba kwomimba.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Ipopo muchaperekewa kuti muendesewe kotambudziwa nokobaiwa. Futi muchazondewa nomarudzi yese nondava yangu. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Uye vazinji vachahedhuka pakutenda, vachazondana vachipandukirana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Vaporofiti vomabhwodo vazinji vachamuka, vachitsambutsa vazinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Nondava yokuingidzika kwouipi, rudo rovazinji ruchaderera. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Asi anotsungirira kusvika pamagumo achaponesewa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Iyoyi Nyaya Idonaka youmambo ichaparidziwa kunyika dzese, seuchapupu kumarudzi yese, ipopo kuguma kunobva kwadzosvika.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinhu Chinochisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mariko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Ruka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Zvino kana maakuona mharadzi yotsambwa inochisa idorehwa namuporofiti Dhanyero, yamira panzvimbo itsvene (anoverenga mbaanzvitsitse), <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />ipopo vari muJudhiya mbavatizire kumakomo <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />ari pamusoro poimba mbaareke kuburuka kotora zviri mumba mache, <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />noari kumunda mbaarekere kudzokera kumba kotora hembe yache. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Vano nhamu vanomimba novanomwisa mumazuva yakareyo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Namatai kuti kutiza kwenyu kureke kuva panguwa yokutonhora kana paSabata. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Ndava ipopo pachava nokutambudzika kukuru, kusinati kwambovapo kubva pamavambo yonyika kusvika manje, futi neye, kunodzovapoba. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Dai mazuva yakareyo yairekera kutapudziwa, hapanai munhu waichira, asi nondava yovadosaruhwa, mazuva yakareyo yachatapudziwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Manje kana munhu akati kwamuri, ‘Nangarai, Khirisitu ari pano’ kana ‘Ari apo’ rekai kuzvitenda. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Ndava ana Khirisitu vomabhwodo novaporofiti vomabhwodo vachamuka vachinangidza zviratidzo zvikuru nozvishamiso, kuti kana zvichikwanisika vatsambutse kana novadosaruhwavo. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Onai, ndagara ndakuudzai.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Saka, kana vakati kwamuri, ‘Onai, ari kusango,’ rekerai kuenda, kana vakati, ‘Onai ari mudzimba dzomukati,’ rekerai kuzvitenda. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Ndava sezvinoita kabhanimani kanobva kumabvazuva kachipenya kuenda kumadokero, ndizvo zvichaita kuuya kwoMwanakomana woMunhu.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Pano chitunha ndipo panoungana magora.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwoMwanakomana woMunhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mariko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Ruka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Panondopera kutambudzika kwomazuva yakareyo, zuva richasvipa, nomwedzi uchareka kuvhenekera kwawene, nonyenyedzi dzichawa kubva kudenga, nomasimba yokudenga yachagwetedzewa. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Ipopo pachaoneka chiratidzo choMwanakomana woMunhu mudenga, uye marudzi yese yopasi yacharira, vachiona Mwanakomana woMunhu achiuya ari pamusoro pomakuti yokudenga nomasimba nokubhwinya kukuru, <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />zvino achatuma ngirozi dzache nokudaidzira kworuzha rohwamanda, idzo dzichaunganidza vadosaruhwa vache kubva kumativi yese yonyika, kubva kumhera kwodenga kuenda kumwe kumhera.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chidzidzo choMukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mariko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Ruka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Dzidzai chidzidzo kubva pamuti womukuyu: kana mathai yakuthungira, waakuita mazani, munoziva kuti mainza yaakusvika. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Naizvozvowo, kana moona zvakarezvi zvese, zivai kuti wava papfupi, pamusuwo chaipo. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, vanhu vonguwa iyoyi vanoperaba kusvikira zvinhu zvakarezvi zvese zvaitika. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Denga nonyika zvichapfuura, asi mashoko yangu yanopfuuraba.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hapanai Anoziva Zuva noNguwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mariko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Ruka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Asi kana riri zuva kana awa iyoyo, hapanai anoziva, kana nongirozi dzokudenga, kana Mwanakomana, asi Baba vega. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Sezvazvanga zvidoita pamazuva yaNowa, ndizvo zvazvichaita pakuuya kwoMwanakomana woMunhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Ndava sepamazuva yakareyo kusati kwava nomurove, vaija vachimwa, vairoora nokuroorewa, kusvikira zuva Nowa raadopinda mungarava, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />havanai kuziva kusvikira mafashamu yauya yachibva yavakukura vese, zvakarezvo ndizvo zvichaita kuuya kwoMwanakomana woMunhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Varume vairi vachange vari mumunda, umwe achatohwa umwe achisiiwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Vakadzi vairi vachange vachikuya paguyo, umwe achatohwa umwe achisiiwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Garirirai ndipo, ndava munozivaba zuva rinouya Ishe wenyu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Asi zivai izvi, kuti dai mwenekachiro woimba waiziva kuti njipi nguwa yousiku inouya mbavha, waigaririra asingabvumire kuti imba yache ipaziwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Saka naimipawo gadzirirai, ndava Mwanakomana woMunhu anouya nonguwa yamusingamutarisire.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuva kana Kusava Muranda Adotendeka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Ruka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Mbani zvino muranda adotendeka adochenjera, adoisiwa natenzi wache pamusoro povaranda vari mumba mache, kuti ambovapasa zvokuja panguwa idokodzera? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Adokomborehwa muranda wakareyo anoti kana tenzi wache achisvika anomuwana achiita daro. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, achamuisa pamusoro pozvinhu zvache zvese. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Asi kana ari muranda adoipa anoti mumwoyo mache, ‘Tenzi wangu wachehwa kuuya,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />wothanga kurova varanda biyache, woja nokumwa novararadzi, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />tenzi womuranda wakareyo achauya nozuva raasingamutarisire nopanguwa yaasingazive, <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />iye achamuranga, achamuisa pabodzi novanyengeri, ipopo vanhu vacharira nokurumanisa meno yavo nondava yokudzimbiwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woVasikana Gumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Umambo hwokudenga hungafananidziwe novasikana gumi vadotora mwenje yavo vachienda kochingura murume. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />vashano vacho vanga vadozungaira, vashano vanga vadochenjera. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Nokuti vadozungaira pavadotora marambe yavo, havanai kutora mafuta, <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />asi vadochenjera vadotora tudende tomafuta pabodzi nomarambe yavo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Murume paadochehwa, vese vadokotsira ndokuenzera.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Asi pakati pousiku padodaidzihwa, ‘Onai murume! Birikai momuchingura.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Ipopo vasikana vaye vese vadomuka vachibatidza marambe yavo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Vadozungaira vadoti kuno vadochenjera, ‘Tipaseiwo yamwe mafuta yenyu, ndava marambe yedu yaakudzimwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Asi vadochenjera vadopindura, ‘Pamwe yanodzokwanaba isisu naimipa, endai kuvatengesi mozvitengera.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Pavadoenda kotenga, murume adosvika, vanga vadogadzirira vadopinda naye mumabiko yomuchato, sasa richibva ravhariwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Mumasure mozvakarezvo vamwe vasikana vadodzouya vachiti, ‘Ishe, Ishe tizururireiwo!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Asi adovapindura achiti, ‘Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, ndinokuzivaiba.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Garirirai ndipo, ndava munozivaba zuva kana awa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woVaranda Vatatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Ruka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Umambo hwaMwari hudofanana pakare nomurume adoenda hwendo, adodaidza varanda vache vaadovimba navo kusiira pfuma yache, <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />umwe adomupasa masaga mashano yondarama, umwe mairi, umwe ribodzi, umwe noumwe adopasiwa maererano nomagonero yache. Saka tenzi adobva waenda zvache. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Uyeuye adotambira masaga yondarama mashano adoenderafuti koita maronda nayo, achibva wawana yamwe mashano pamusoro. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ndomwenze kamu nouye wanga anomasaga yondarama mairi adowana yamwe mairi. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Asi uye adotambira ribodzi adoenda koricherera pasi achivikha mari yatenzi wache.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Zvino kwapera nguwa irefu tenzi wovaranda vakarevo adouya kudzovabvunza zvavanga vaita nomari yache. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Iyeuye adotambira masaga yondarama mashano adouya achipereka yamwe mashano achiti, ‘Tenzi mudonditambidza masaga yondarama mashano, ndino yamwe yandidoingidzira mashano.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Tenzi wache adoti kwaari, ‘Hekani, muranda adonaka adotendeka, udova adotendeka pazvishoma, ndichakuita mukuru pazvizinji. Pinda mumufaro watenzi wako.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Nouye wanga ano masaga yondarama mairi adouyawo achiti, ‘Tenzi, mudondipasa masaga yondarama mairi, ndaingidzira yamwe mairi pamusoro poyamudondipasa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Tenzi wache adoti kwaari, ‘Inde, muranda adonaka adotendeka, wanga udotendeka pazvishoma, ndichakuisa pamusoro pozvizinji. Pinda mumufaro watenzi wako.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Nyakupasiwa saga rondarama ribodzi adouyawo achiti, ‘Tenzi ndidokuzivai kuti muri munhu adooma, munokohwa pamusinai kujara, nokuunganidza pamusinai kuwaza mbeu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Saka ndidocha, ndokubva ndaenda kovikha muivhu saga renyu rondarama. Onai, ndiri saga renyu rondarama.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Asi tenzi wache adomupindura achiti, ‘Naiwe muranda adoipa nyanungo, handiti waiziva kuti ndinokohwa pandisinai kujara, nokuunganidza pandisinai kuwaza mbeu? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Saka dai udoisaka mari yangu kubhengi, kuti pakuuya kwangu ndidzoitambira yabereka. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Saka mutorerei saga rondarama raanaro, muripase ano masaga gumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ndava wese anozvaanazvo, achapasiwa zvimwe zvidowanda, wova nozvizinji. Asi uyo asinai chinhu achatorehwa nochaanacho peno. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Khandirai muranda wakareyo asinai nokabonyo kese murima rokunze, kwakareko vanhu vacharira nokurumanisa meno yavo nondava nokudzimbiwa.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutongewa kwoMarudzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Pachauya Mwanakomana woMunhu mukubhwinya kwache, pabodzi nongirozi dzache, achagarikika pamupando wache unobhwinya. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Pamberi pache pachaunganidziwa marudzi yese, achayakamuranisa kunge nyakabusa anokamura mahwai kubva kumbudzi, <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />achaisa hwai kuruoko rache roruji, asi mbudzi kurubose. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Ipopo Mambo achati kuno vari kuruoko rache roruji, ‘Uyai imi, vadoropafadziwa vaBaba vangu, garai nhaka yamudogadzirihwa kubva pamavambo yonyika, <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />ndava pandanga ndino nzara mudondipasa chokuja, pandanga ndino nyota mudondipasa chokumwa, pandanga ndiri murendo mudonditambira, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />pandanga ndiri pedzi mudondisimidza, pandanga ndichihwara mudondibvakachira, pandanga ndiri mutorongo mudouya kwandiri.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Ipopo vadorurama vachamupindura vachiti, ‘Ishe, ndirini patidokuonai muno nzara tikakuposhai, kana muno nyota tikakupasai chokumwa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ndirini patidokuonai muri murendo tikakutambirai, kana muri pedzi tikakusimidzai? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ndirini patidokuonai muchihwara kana muri mutorongo tikakubvakachirai? <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mambo achavapindura achiti, ‘Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, pamudozviitira umwe wohama dzangu dzidiki idzi, mudoitira inipano.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Zvino achati kuno vari kuruoko romamose, ‘Ibvai kwandiri, imi vadoshurikidziwa, muende kumoto wokusingapere udogadzirihwa Sathani nongirozi dzache, <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />nokuti pandanga ndino nzara hapanai chokuja chamudondipasa, ndino nyota hapanai chokumwa chamudondipasa, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />pandanga ndiri murendo hamunai kunditambira, ndiri pedzi hamunai kundisimidza, ndichihwara futi ndiri mutorongo hamunai kundibvakachira.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Ipopo naivo vachapindurawo vachiti, ‘Ishe, ndirini patidokuonai muno nzara kana muno nyota, kana muri murendo kana muri pedzi kana muchihwara kana muri mutorongo, tikareka kukushumirai?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Ipopo Ishe achavapindura achiti, ‘Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, pamusinai kuzviitira umwe wovadiki ava, hamunai kuzviitira inini.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Zvino vachaenda kumurango wokusingapere, asi vadorurama kuupenyu husingapere.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Kurangana Kubaya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mariko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Ruka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Johwani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Jesu paadopedza kunyaira kwese uku, adoti kuvadzidzi vache, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Munoziva kuti musure momazuva mairi Phasika iri kuuya, uye Mwanakomana woMunhu achaisiwa kuti arovehwe pamuchinjikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ipopo vaphirisita vakuru novatungamiri vovanhu vadoungana mumuzinda womuphirisita mukuru, waiitiwa Kefasi, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />ndokurangana pabodzi masungiro yavangaite Jesu zvokubiridzira vachimubaya. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Asi vadoti, “Mbazvireke kuitiwa pamutambo wophasika, ndava pangadzoita bongozozo pakati povanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozodzewa paBhetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mariko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:1-8">Ruka 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Zvino Jesu paanga ari paBhetani mumba maSimoni wanga anomabobo, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mukadzi wanga ano guchu romapfuta yanodhura maninge adouya paari, ndokuyadururira mumusoro wache, iye Jesu paanga adogarikika pakuja. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Asi vadzidzi pavadozviona, vadotsva mwoyo nazvo, ndokubva vati, “Indava yei kucheneka mapfuta yoya daipa? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Ndava mapfuta yakareya yaifanira kutengesewa nomari izinji, mariyo yopasiwa varombo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Asi Jesu achizviziva, adoti kwavari, “Indava yei muchimunetsa mukadzi iyeyu? Nokuti waita chinhu chidonaka kwandiri. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Ndava varombo munavo nguwa dzese, asi muchavaba nainini nguwa dzese. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Pakudururira kwaaita mapfuta yanonushira pamuviri wangu atogadzirira kuvigiwa kwangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, kwese kuchaparidziwa vhangeri iri pasi pese, zvaaita zvichatauriwa achiyeukiwa nazvo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judhasi Anopandukira Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10">Mariko 14:10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Ruka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Ipopo umwe wovadzidzi gumi novairi, waiitiwa Judhasi Sikariyoti, adoenda kuvapirista vakuru <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />achiti, “Chii chamuchandipasa kana Jesu ndamupereka kwamuri?” Ivo vadomuripa masirivha makumi matatu. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kubva panguwa yakareyo adotsvaga mukana wokumupandukira.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoja Chirairo choPhasika noVadzidzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mariko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Ruka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Johwani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Zvino pazuva rokuthanga roMazingwa Yasinai Mbiriso vadzidzi vadouya kuna Jesu, vachiti, “Nghupi kwamunoda kuti tikugadzirirei kuti mujire Phasika?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Adoti, “Endai muguta kwanembi uye, muti kwaari, ‘Mudzidzisi ari kuti, Nguwa yangu yava kusvika, ndichajira Phasika kumba kwako pabodzi novadzidzi vangu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Vadzidzi vadoita zvavadoraihwa naJesu, vachibva vagadzira kuja kwophasika.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Payanga yava mauro, adogara pakuja novadzidzi vache gumi novairi, <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />vachija daipo, adoti kwavari, “Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, umwe wenyu achandipandukira.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ivo vadosuwa chaizvo, ndokuthanga mubodzi mubodzi kumubvunza vachiti, “Nai Ishe, ndini chere?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Adopindura achiti, “Uyo wapinza ruoko rache mumbenge pabodzi nainini, ndiye achandipandukira. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwanakomana woMunhu anoenda sezvidonyohwa pamusoro pache, asi mayanga kumunhu wakareyo anomupandukira! Zvaitova hasa dai munhu wakareyo asinai kuzvahwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Judhasi, nyakumupandukira, adoti, “Ndini chere nai Ishe?” Adoti kwaari, “Watozvinyaira.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chirairo chaIshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mariko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Ruka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 VaKorinde 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Zvino pavanga vachija, Jesu adotora zingwa, achiropafadza, ndokurikomora, achiripasa vadzidzi achiti, “Torai muje, wakareyu muviri wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Ipopo adotora mukombe, paadopereka nhendo adovapasa, achiti, “Imwai kubva pauri mese, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />ndava rakareri igazi rangu rochibvumirano, rinoteurihwa vazinji kuti varegerehwe zvitadzo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Ndinokunyepai, ndichamwaba kamu zvomuchero wakareyu womuzambiringa kusvikira zuva randinoumwa nemi wava mutsva muUmambo hwaBaba vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Pavadoimba chimbo, vadobirika kuenda kuGomo romiOrivhi.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozivisa Kuramba kwaPita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Ruka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Johwani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kwavari, “Usiku huno mese muchanditiza, ndava kudonyohwa, ‘Ndicharova nyakabusa, ipopo boka romahwai richapamwara.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Asi kana ndamutsiwa, ndichakutangirai kuenda kuGaririya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Pita adokohomedza ndokuti kwaari, “Kana vakakutizai vese, inini ndinokusiyaiba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwauri, usiku hwakarehuno, jongwe risati rarira, uchandiramba katatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Pita adoti kwaari, “Kana ndichitofanira kupfa nemi, ndinokurambaiba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Vadzidzi vese vadodarowo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonamata muGetsimani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mariko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Ruka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Zvino Jesu adoenda navo kunzvimbo inoitiwa Getsimani, ndokuti kuvadzidzi vache, “Garai pano inini ndichaenda uko konamata.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Adotora Pita novanakomana vairi vaZebhedhi, adothanga kunzva usoma nokutambudzika. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Ipopo adoti kwavari, “Mwoyo wangu uri kusurukihwa chaizvo, zvokutosvika pakupfa, sarai pano, mugaririre neni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Wandoti endei pamberi pashoma adowira pasi ndokunamata adoenzera nodumbu achiti, “Baba vangu, kana zvichigoneka, mukombe uyu womatambudziko mbaubiritsiwe kwandiri! Zvisinei, mbakureke kuva kuda kwangu, asi kuve kuda kwenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Adouya kuvadzidzi ndokuvawana vaenzera, adobva wati kuna Pita, “Saka matadza kugaririra neni kwoawa ibodzi? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />“Garirirai munamate kuti mureke kupinda pamuedzo, mweya unoda zvawene, asi muviri udoneta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Adoenda kamu kochipiri, achinamata, “Baba vangu, kana mukombe uyu usingagone kubiritsiwa kwandiri kunze kwokuti ndiumwe, kuda kwenyu mbakuitiwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Adouya kamu achivawana vaenzera, ndava meso yavo yanga yava nohope.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Saka adovasiya kamu, achienda konamata kochitatu, achitaura mashoko mabodzi bodziyo. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Paadouya kuvadzidzi adoti kwavari, “Muchidoenzera nokuzorora zvenyu? Nangarai, awa yasvika, Mwanakomana woMunhu waakupandukihwa achiisiwa mumanja yovatadzi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Sumukai tiende, onai anondipandukira wasvika.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusungiwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mariko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Ruka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Johwani 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Paanga achiri kunyaira, Judhasi umwe wovadzidzi gumi novairi adouya, ano mhomho ikuru yanga ino mapakatwa nonduni, vanga vatumiwa novaphirisita vatungamiri novakuru vovanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Zvino mupanduki wanga wavapasa chiratidzo achiti, “Wandichatsvoda ndiye wakareyo, momubata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Adobva wauyirafuti pana Jesu achiti, “Moroi, Mudzidzisi,” achimutsvoda.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Shamwari wavingei pano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Ipopo vadosvika vachibata Jesu nokumusunga. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ona, umwe wovanga vana Jesu adosvoronora bakatwa rache, ndokutema achigwata nzeve yomuranda womuphirisita mukuru. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kwaari, “Dzotsera bakatwa panzvimbo yarene, ndava vese vanobata bakatwa vachaparadziwa nobakatwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Munofunga kuti ndinokonaba nai kukumbira Baba vangu, kuti vanditumire nokamangu mapoka yongirozi dzinohwa yanodarika gumi nomairi? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Asi manje magwaro yangazazisiwe tini, yanoti zvinofanira kuitika daipo?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Panguwa iyoyo Jesu adoti kumhomho, “Anga mauya nomapakatwa nonduni kudzondibata kunge muri kuvinga gananga? Apa mazuva yese ndaigarikika muimba yaMwari ndichidzidzisa, musingandibati. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Asi zvese zvakarezvi zvaitika kuitira kuzazisa magwaro yovaporofiti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ipopo vadzidzi vese vadotiza vachimusiya.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Pamberi poVabati vaGuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mariko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Ruka 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Johwani 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ipopo vanyakusunga Jesu vadomuendesa kuna Khefasi muphirisita mukuru, kwanga kudoungana vadzidzisi vomutemo novatungamiri vovanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Asi Pita adomutevera ari kurefu, kunge kuchivanze chomuphirisita mukuru, paadopinda adogara novarindi kuti aone magumo yazvene. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Zvino vaphirisita vakuru nodare rese vadotsvaga pfakazi dzomabhwodo dzokuroverera Jesu kuti vagone kumubaya, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />asi vadodzisaya, kana nepo pfakazi dzizinji dzidouya pamberi. Pakupedzisira pfakazi dzomabhwodo dziiri dzidouya pamberi <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />dzichiti, “Munhu uyu adoti, ‘Ndinogona kupunza imba yaMwari, ndichiivakha nomazuva matatu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Zvino muphirisita mukuru adosumuka achiti, “Haunai mhinduro nai? Chii varume ava chavari kukunenera?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Asi Jesu adonyarara. Ipopo muphirisita mukuru adoti kwaari, “Ndinoda kuti upike naMwari mupenyu, utiudze kana uri Khirisitu, Mwanakomana waMwari.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Wazvinyaira ndiwe. Asi ndinokunyepa, kubva zvino uchaona Mwanakomana woMunhu adogarikika kuruoko roruji roAnosimba, achiuya ari pamusoro pomakuti yokudenga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ipopo muphirisita mukuru adokerura hembe yache, achiti, “Wanyaira zvokushora. Pfakazi tichadzidirei? Manzva zvino kushora kwache. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Munozvionawo sei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Vadopindura vachiti, “Anofanira kupfa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ipopo vadomusvipira pachiso, vachimukahamura. Vamwe vachimukwatsamura, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />vachiti, “Porofita kwatiri, iwe Khirisitu! Mbani wakurova?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anoramba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mariko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Ruka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Johwani 18:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Zvino Pita anga adogarikika kunze muchivanze chodare. Mushandirikadzi adouya kwaari, achiti, “Naiwepa wanga una Jesu woGaririya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Asi adozviramba pamberi pavo vese, achiti, “Ndinozivaba zvaunoreva ini.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Paadobirika kuenda pamusuwo mukuru, umwe mushandirikadzi adomuona, achibva wati kuno vanga vadomira, “Murume uyu anga ana Jesu woNazareta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Naipopa kamu adozviramba achitopika, “Ndinomuzivaba murume uyu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Papera kanguwa vanga vadomira vadouya vachiti kuna Pita, “Chokwadi iwepa uri mabiyavo, ndava kutongedzera kwako kunokubatisa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ipopo adothanga kuzvishurikidza nokupika, “Handimuzive murume uyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Pakarepo jongwe ridorira. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Zvino Pita adoyeuka kunyaira kwaJesu, “Jongwe risati rarira, uchandiramba katatu.” Adobirika kunze ndokurira zvinosiririsa.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoisiwa kuna Pirato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mariko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Ruka 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Johwani 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Yava mangwanani, vakuru vovaphirisita vese novatungamiri vovanhu vadogara dare rokutongera Jesu ipfa, <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />vadomusunga vachienda naye komupereka kuna Pirato mutongi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judhasi Anozvibaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Judhasi mupandukiri wache paadoona kuti Jesu watongehwa ipfa, adozvija mwoyo ndokudzotsa masirivha yacho makumi matatu kuvakuru vovaphirisita novatungamiri vovanhu <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />achiti, “Ndatadza ndapandukira munhu asinai mhosva.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Vadoti, “Zvinei nesu? Basa rako.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Adokhandira masirivha muimba yaMwari, ndokubirika achienda karisungirira.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Asi vakuru vovaphirisita vadotora masirivha yacho vachiti, “Hazvisi pamurau kuti yaisiwe muchivigiro, sezvo yari mari yomagazi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Saka vadopangana, kuti vayatengese munda womuumbi wohari, kuti vadzovigira vatohwa makaremo. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Saka munda wakareyo nanasi unodaidziwa kuti Munda woGazi.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ipopo padozazisiwa zvidorehwa namuporofiti Joromiya, paadoti, “Vadotora masirivha makumi matatu, mutengo waiye ano mitengo idotahwa novanhu vomuIzirairi, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />ndokuyapasa kumunda womuumbi wohari, sekuraihwa kwandidoitiwa naIshe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pirato Anobvunza Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mariko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Ruka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Johwani 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Zvino Jesu adomira pamberi pomutongi, mutongi adomubvunza achiti, “Ndiwe chere mambo wovaJudha?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Jesu adoti, “Wazvinyaira ndiwe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Asi paainenedzehwa novakuru vovaphirisita novatungamiri vovanhu, adopinduraba.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ipopo Pirato adoti kwaari, “Unonzvaba muwandiro wozvinhu zvavanokunenera?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Asi haanai kumupindura, kana pachipomehwa chibodzi zvachene, zvokuti mutongi adoshamisika chaizvo.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotongehwa Ipfa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mariko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Ruka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Johwani 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Zvino pamutambo wophasika mutongi anga ano tsika yokusunungurira mhomho musungwa upi zvache wavaida. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Zvino vanga vano musungwa waizikana, waiitiwa Bharabhasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Saka pavanga vaungana, Pirato adoti kwavari, “Mbani wamunoda kuti ndikusunungurirei, Jesu anonzi Bharabhasi kana kuti Jesu anoitiwa Khirisitu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Ndava Pirato waiziva kuti vanga vamupereka nondava yochanje.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pirato paanga adogarikika pamupando wokutonga, mukadzi wache adotumira shoko kwaari achiti, “Reka kuwana chaunoita nomurume adorurama uyo, ndava nasi ndatambudzika chaizvo kuhope nondava yache.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Zvino vaphirisita vakuru novakuru vadopenzveredza vanhu kuti vakumbire Bharabhasi vabaye Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pakamu mutongi adoti kwavari, “Ngupi pavairi wamunoda kuti ndikusungunurirei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Vadoti, “Bharabhasi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pirato adoti kwavari, “Saka chii chandichaita naJesu anoitiwa Khirisitu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Vese vadoti, “Mbaarovehwe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Iye adoti, “Nondava yei, chii chidoipa chaadoita?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Asi vese vadokungudzirafuti kudaidzira, “Mbaarovehwe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Zvino Pirato paadoona kuti hapanai chaari kuwana, kunze kwokutothanga bongozozo, adotora mvura achishamba manja yache pamberi pomhomho, achiti, “Handinai mhosva pagazi romurume uyu, zvionerei mega.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Vanhu vese vadopindura vachiti, “Gazi rache mbarive pamusoro pedu nopovana vedu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Ipopo adovasunungurira Bharabhasi, ndokurova Jesu achimupereka kuti arovehwe pamuchinjikwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mauto Yanonyadza Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mariko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Johwani 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ipopo mauto yomutongi yadotora Jesu yachimupinza mumuzinda, vadounganidza mauto yese pamberi pache. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Vadomusunhura, vachimusimidza jasi ritsvuku, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />ndokuruka korona yominzva vachimudzika mumusoro mache, vachimubatisa tsanga mujanja rache roruji. Vadopfugama pamberi pache zvomusese, vachiti, “Moroi mambo wovaJudha!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Vadomusvipira, ndokutora tsanga vachimbondomurova nayo mumusoro. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Vadobva vamunyadza, vadomusunhura jasi, vachimusimidza hembe yache, ndokuenda naye komurovera pamuchinjikwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorovehwa Pamuchinjikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mariko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Ruka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Johwani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Pavaibirika kuenda, vadokumana nomurume woSairini, anozita rokuti Simoni, vadosukumidza murume wakareyu kutakura muchinjikwa wache. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Pavadosvika panzvimbo inoitiwa Gorogota (kureva kuti nzvimbo yodehenya), <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />vadomupasa waini kuti amwe, idokumanisiwa nonduru, asi paadoiraidza, adoramba kuimwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Vabva kumurovera, vadokovana hembe dzache nokukhanda hakata, <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />vadodzogara pasi pakarepo vachiramba vadomugaririra. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Pamusoro pache vadoturika chinyohwa chomhosva yache chaiti, “Uyu ndiJesu, Mambo wovaJudha.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Zvino makororo mairi yadorovehwa pabodzi naye, rimwe kuruji rimwe kurubose.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Vaipinda nopakarepo vadomushora vachikwetekwedza misoro yavo <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />vachiti, “Iwepa wokuda kupwanya imba yaMwari uchiivakha nomazuva matatu, chizviponesaka! Kana uri Mwanakomana waMwari, buruka pamuchinjikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Nzvibodzizvo novaphirisita vakuru, novadzidzisi vomutemo novatungamiri vovanhu, vadomuseka, vachiti, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Adochidza vamwe, achitadza kuzvichidza. Ndiye mambo wovaIzirairi, mbaaburuke pamuchinjikwa, timutende. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Anovimba naMwari, Mwari mbaachimununura zvino, kana achimuda, ndava waiti, ‘Ndini Mwanakomana waMwari.’”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Nomakororo vanga vadorovehwa pabodzi naye vadomumbombodzerawo nonzira ibodzi bodziyo.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupfa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Ruka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Johwani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Zvino kubva paawa yogumi nodziiri padoita rima panyika yese, kusvika paawa yogumi nodzishano. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Paawa yochipfemba Jesu adodaidzira noizvi ropamusoro, “Eri, Eri, ramasabhakatani?” Ndokuti, “Mwari wangu, Mwari wangu, mandisiireiko?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Vamwe vanga vadomira pakarepo pavadozvinzva vadoti, “Murume uyu ari kudaidza Eriya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Umwe wacho adobva wamhanyirafuti kotora chipanje, ndokuchinyika muvhiniga, achichijungirira patsanga, achibva wamupasa kuti amwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Asi vamwe ndovadoti, “Mirai tione kana Eriya achiuya kudzomuchidza.<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Jesu adodaidzira kamu noizvi ropamusoro achibva warosa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Nonguwa yakareyo, biza romuimba yaMwari ridokeruka kuita mairi kubva kumusoro kuenda pasi. Nyika idogwetedzeka, mabhwe yadobamuka, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />makuwa yadovhurika, zvitunha zvizinji zvovatsvene vanga vadopfa zvidomutsiwa, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />vadobirika mumakuwa musure mokumuka kwache vachipinda muguta ritsvene vachionewa novazinji.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Mukuru wozana romauto novaanga anavo, vadogaririra Jesu, pavadoona kugwetedzeka kwonyika nozvidoitika, vadozaziwa nokucha, vachiti, “Chokwadi uyu wanga ari Mwanakomana waMwari!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Paivawo novakadzi vadowanda vaimushumira vanga vatevera Jesu kubva kuGaririya, vainangara vari kurefu. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Pakati pavo panga pana Mariya Magadharina, naMariya amai vaJakobho naJosefa, naamai vovanakomana vaZebhedhi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvigiwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Ruka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Johwani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Yava mauro, padouya murume mupfumi kubva kuAramatiya, waiitiwa Josefa, wanga ariwo mudzidzi waJesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Adoenda kuna Pirato achikumbira kuti apasiwe chitunha chaJesu. Ipopo Pirato adoraira kuti achipasiwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Zvino Josefa adotora chitunha, ndokuchiputiridza nofuko ridochena, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />achichiradzika muguwa rache ritsva, raanga adofonga padombo, ndokukungurutsira ibhwe pamuromo poguwa, achibva waenda. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariya wokuguta roMagadhara noumwe Mariya vanga varipo, vadogarikika padonangarana noguwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Varindi paGuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Zuva ridotevera, kureva, zuva roSabata, vakuru vovaphirisita novaFarisi vadoungana kuna Pirato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />vachiti, “Changamire,” tinoyeuka zvidonyaihwa nomunyengeri uyu, achiri mupenyu adoti, ‘Sure kwomazuva matatu ndichamuka kamu.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Saka rairai kuti guwa richengetewe kusvikira pazuva rochitatu, kuti vadzidzi vache vareke kuenda komuba, vachidzoudza vanhu kuti, ‘Wamuka kubva kuvadopfa,’ mabhwodo yokupedzisira yanganyangaritse kukunda yokuthanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pirato adoti kwavari, “Torai varindi kuti vaende korichengetedza semaziviro yenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Saka vadoenda kochengetedza guwa ndokuisa chidhindo padombo rarene nokuisa varindi.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kumuka kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mariko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Ruka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Johwani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Zvino mumasure moSabata, mambakwedza yozuva rokuthanga rosondo, Mariya woguta roMagadhara noumwe Mariya vadoenda koona guwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Zvino padoita kugwetedzeka kwonyika kukuru, nokuti ngirozi yaIshe idoburuka kubva kudenga ndokuuya ichikungurutsa ibhwe racho, ndokugarikika pamusoro parene. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Kuoneka kwache kwaiita kunge mheni, hembe dzache dzidochena kunge matarara. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Nokumucha, varindi vadotetemera vachibva vaoma muviri kunge vapfa.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Asi ngirozi idoti kuvakadzi, “Rekai kucha, ndava ndinoziva kuti muri kutsvaga Jesu wanga adorovehwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Haapo pano, ndava wamuka, sezvaadotaura. Uyai, onai nzvimbo paanga adoradzikiwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Saka endai nokukurumidza moudza vadzidzi vache kuti wamuka kuvadopfa, nangarai, achakuthangirai kuenda kuGaririya, kwakareko ndokwamuchamuona, Tetekerai, ndakuudzai.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Saka vadobva paguwa nokamangu, vachicha asi vadozara nomufaro, ndokubva vatizira vachienda koudza vadzidzi vache.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ipopo, Jesu adobva wakumana navo akati, “Moroi!” Ivo vadouya vachibata tsoka dzache vachimunamata. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kwavari, “Rekai kucha, endai konyepa hama dzangu kuti dziende kuGaririya, vachandiona kwakareko.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvidozivisiwa noVarindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Vachienda kudaro, vamwe varindi vadopinda muguta vachiudza vaphirisita vakuru zvese zvidoitika. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Zvino vakuru vovaphirisita vadoungana novatungamiri vovanhu vachipangana, ndokupasa mari mauto <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />vachiti, “Udzai vanhu kuti, ‘Vadzidzi vache vadouya usiku vachimuba isisu tidoenzera.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Kana izvi zvikasvika munzeve dzomutongi, tichamugutsa tichikubisai mupfumvu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Mauto yadotora mari ndokuita zvavadoudziwa, nyaya yakareyo idopararira pakati povaJudha kusvikira pazuva ranasi.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozvinangidza kuVadzidzi Vache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Ruka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Johwani 20:19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Zvino vadzidzi vanogumi nomubodzi vadoenda kuGaririya, kugomo ravadoraihwa naJesu kuti vaende. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Pavadomuona vadomunamata, asi vamwe vadotsakidza. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Zvino Jesu adouya kwavari achiti, “Ndidopasiwa chikuriri chese kudenga nopanyika. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Nokudaro endai kumarudzi yese muite vadzidzi yomarudzi yese, muvaombeke muzita raBaba noroMwanakomana noroMweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />muchivafundisa kuchengeta zvese zvandidokurairai, onai, ndinemi nguwa dzese kusvika kumagumo yonguwa.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>